<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MLK-NGƆMBƐ-BONDJALE</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Malako</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bwɛndi Bopele elenge ekoma Malako</para>
  <para style="imt">Eingeli e buku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Edi mokanda monɔi na bokue ta mikanda imi mimɛi. Ta makomi mabalaka boo Malako, adi mwange e Polo na Piɛlɛ. Mibalo mi boso midi pungola: Bwɛndi Bopele, bodimedjaka boo Yesu adi «Kilito» ko «Mwana o Ndjakomba» 1, 1-2, 44. «Kilito» adiakabi tingo esusu ta monɔkɔ mo Piɛlɛ ngɔngɔ i mibalo ko na misala ta Galilea 8, 29 ko «Mwana o Ndjakomba» ta monɔkɔ mo ikita inɛnɛ i bayuda ta boso bo bogwa ta ekulusu 15, 39.</para>
  <para style="is">Modjɔ mo tina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bwɛndi Bopele bobangi na bokue 1, 1-2, 13. Botɔndɔmɔkɔ na mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya, Yoane Mobatisi abɔngedjaka bato banɛnɛ tine boasɔ molomami o Ndjakomba: edi Yesu o Nasaleta.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e boso e mokanda 1, 14-8, 30 ebalamaka tine Bwɛndi Bopele ko tine bodua bo bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Donga ta mbangi e Bwɛndi Bopele, Yesu aputoanedjaka batingami ba nde. Malako ainedjaka bokondji bo nde, oko ta ehole elehakayo bato banɛnɛ, ehole eheledjakayo bato ba bipeko, ehole egameakayo bakomi ba mobeko ko bapalusai. Ta ekenge e babae, Yesu akɛkɛ ta bosukedja mohelo mo nde na binɔngi ko bokɛ agwa ta Yelusalɛmɛ 8, 31-10, 52. Ta mbala e isato atɔndeaka batingami ba nde, endolo baisipoaka. Yesu asinedjaka seko oko elenge «Mwana o Moto», edi ebaeli e bokamoa eidaka na ngulu ebosidja bo Ndjakomba ibodaka ta tei e bomoto bo nde. Ekenge e basato enɔmɔkɔ ta Yelusalɛmɛ 11, 1-13, 37. Yesu akumedjamaka endolo, abenganaka batɛki ta tepelo, anedjaka badaledji ba tepelo e Isalɛlɛ; aenɛkɛ meako mabalamake ta tina e batingami ba nde, na bea abapingedjaka tine «Boda na edinga» ta tei e bodima.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ekenge e banɛi ko e suka ebangaka na midjɔ mipipo 14, 1-16, 8. Bikenge bimina bisundolamake na bato basusu ko pongono na batingami ibayakaka na nde mia ma pasika. Yesu ainedjaka boo apeamake, asambedjamake na bakumu ba Ekelesa ko na Pilato, gupɛnɛlɛ o Loma. Yesu akabamake ko abakamake ta ekulusu. Na bea pumasɛnɛ esena e bogwa bo nde, edaka na bali ibataneaka ikila i nde bwase. Ta boenɛ meako mia mibokamoa boo Yesu adi na bomɔ, bayekamaka ko batiaka. Makomi makina mabakeamaka tine boenɛmɛ, bopusoama bo Yesu ko na elomu e batingami ba nde 16, 20.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta boinedjama boo eidaka ta malako ma bakilito, tengasa bikenge bisusu ibidaka isa adi Matayo, Luka ko ta Bwɛndi Bopele bo Malako, ibolangamaka naikina ta bohu ta yanga e koto tuku ibae. Malɛi ma nde ko na djebeli e nde e bobala edi busa bu edimamake mɛnɛ. Ta tei e mokanda mu, Yesu adaka mbuti ba bato ibanɔngɔkɔ, endolo edikamaka elenge mobunga mopɛ bopala boinedja bohu ta modjɔ momina. Bomoto bo nde ko Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi modjɔ momɔti. Ko lasahɔdjɔkɔ naikina mbunoko busa bu. Edi Bokumu bo Ndjakomba nde? Epalaka bobala mɛnɛ kombe e «Kilito» nde? Ta mahɔdjɔ mamina maendji bodima, pɛ moto oboani bosɔmbedja pɛpɛlɛ. Etungi moehole ko etungi odale na ilɛno imɔti engbanga na batingami. Etungi enɔme na djenge eimedjaka modjɔ moendji bogwa ko mo bopusoa bo «Mwana o Ndjakomba». Bwɛndi Bopele bo Malako bodi mokanda mopele mo boikoa, napɛ ebango bɛngi oimee mokilito. Embete e nde edi elenge tito o swa, edi elenge epweya e tito ba esika ibadaka nase i bokondji bo Yesu ehole edakayo ta etengelenge 1, 1-2, 13.</para>
  <para style="is">Tine bokɛ bohali</para>
  <para style="ip">Ta tine balangi bakina ba mobalo mo Ndjakomba, edi mokanda mo boso. Mokanda momina mobalamakabi tine tati e Piɛlɛ. Edae Matayo, Luka badjebaka. Boso bo bianga 65-70 ngɔngɔ i bobotama bo Yesu ta ehole yena einedjamaka etumba ta ekenge enɛnɛ e 13. Elenge etingodjaka misala mi bayuda, lalɛdjɛkɛ boo abalaka na bapangano. Na bonɔ pongono Matayo ko Luka, alonaka bato ba indjendje. Apingedjaka ta tine moda mo binɔngi bipipo bi Yesu, yona ogwaka ko asundolamaka na bato basusu. Endolo Yesu aenɛmɛkɛ elenge «Kilito», Masiya yona olumedjaka ndingo e Isalɛlɛ, endolo napɛ boda na malɛno mabe. Ekada ta tine bomoto bo nde elenge «Mwana o Ndjakomba», bomoto bua ibodjebamaka ta ehole e inelo e nde ko edimedjamaka ta ehole esendjakayo mokuku, elonamaka na bokumu bosusu ko na sueya esusu tine boo bosoti bo nde boenɛmɛkɛ ta ekulusu!</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eleho e Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoa 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Mbangi e Bwɛndi Bopele bo Yesu Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi makina maditi na kombe </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mwana o Ndjakomba.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />elenge ekomama ta buku e mbaeli o Ndjakomba Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nalomake moto o mbi o elomu boso bo wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">tine bobɔngedja ndjea.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Edi yona adumbeaka ta etengelenge:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Bɔngedjani ndjea e Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">ninodjani ndjea e nde bodjo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 40, 3</char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Na bea, Yoane adaka ta etengelenge; ko adaka adumbea. Hombedjani milema mi bino, inamani, bɛngi Ndjakomba aoyɛni mabe ma bino!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoane Mobatisi... </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi makina mabalaka boo Yoane adaka ta etengelenge; abatisaka ko alehaka. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Hombedjani milema </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Hombedjani mida </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kinani mabe.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bato basusu ba mokpɔtɔ mo Yudea ko ba Yelusalɛmɛ bakɛkɛ adi yo; badimaka bohu mabe ma bobo ko Yoane abainaka ta duwa e Yolodane. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yoane alwaka esendja etonga bo na ngungi i tito o kamela ko na mosenge mopipo ta bongo bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bak o babae 1, 8.</char></note>; adaka boyaka ndoko ko na pɔki i esika. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Adaka botɔndea bato: «Yona aduake ngɔngɔ i mbi anɔini na sueya; naboaniti bosunama tine bolodja ngɔli i sapato i nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Mbi, noinakani na madiba, endolo yo, aonabini na Mwembo Mosɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inelo ko bomekama bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mat 3, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4, 11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Na bea, Yesu ahulaka ta Nasaleta, ibonga i Galilea ko ainamaka na Yoane ta duwa e Yolodane. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ta boduboa bo nde ta madiba, aenɛ busa bodipoama ko Mwembo Mosɛnɔke atita adi yo elenge embenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ko kɔpi eokamaka donga ta busa: «Odi mwana o mbi oepaeli; nasepi na wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokokanedja na Ndj 2, 7; Isa 42, 1.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Na mbala emɔti, Mwembo amolomaka ta etengelenge. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Yesu adikamaka oho masu tuku inɛi ko amekamaka na satana. Adaka na tito ba esika ko babwɛndji bamokɔmedjaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei baowoi ba swi banɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4, 12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5, 1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Ngɔngɔ i boisa Yoane ta bɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yoa aisami ta bɔlɔkɔ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edaka Yoane Mobatisi. Endja 6, 17.</char></note>, Yesu akɛkɛ ta Galilea; alehaka Bwɛndi Bopele bo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Ko adaka abala: «Ehole eboani, ko bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobatami! Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni milema </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Sɔmbɔtɔnɔni mida </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kinani mabe.</char></note> ko dimani Bwɛndi Bopele!» <verse eid="MRK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Busa bomɔti, Yesu anɔkɔ ta mokula mo ibeke ibonga i Galilea. Ena aenɛkɛ baowoi babae ba swi, Simo na Andele, ibadaka badumba midjanga mi bobo ta ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Kimanini ko noimedjakeni bahombi ba bato.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Na mbala emɔti, bakinaka midjanga mi bobo ko bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Yesu asadaledjaka moohali ko aenɛkɛ Djake na mwange e nde Yoane, bana ba Djebede, ibadaka pongono ta bwato, babɔngedja midjanga mi bobo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Na mbala emɔti Yesu ababeaka; bakinaka sange e bobo Djebede ta bwato na basali; ko bakɛkɛ na Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Momi odaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu na batingami ba nde bakɛkɛ ta ibonga i Kapalanauma. Ta busa bo sabata, Yesu akweaka ta sinagoga ko abangaka boleha. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Bato i bamohokamedjaka bakamoaka na mondumba mo boleha bo nde; tengasa alehaka elenge moto odi na kpatsi endolo te elenge balehi ba mobeko. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Na bea, ta sinagoga, momi omɔti atungeamaka na mwembo mobe. Alɛbɛkɛ: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Yesu o Nasaleta, tina ndani okwɛi ta midjɔ mi biso? Odoi tine bolowa? Nodjebaka bopele mɛnɛ: Mosɛnɔke olomama na Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu amogameaka ko abalaka: «Pɔpɔnɔ ko ima adi momi yo!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mwembo mobe mopukusaka momi omina na ngulu mɛnɛ ko moimaka na bolɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bato basusu bakamoaka ko basahɔdjɔkɔ: «Iye nde! Eleho eyanie alehamaka na kpatsi! Agameaka miembo mibe ko mimosumaka!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ko na mbala emɔti gala e Yesu enanganaka ta mabonga masusu ma Galilea.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bipeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4, 38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ta boima bo nde ta sinagoga, Yesu akɛkɛ na Djake engbanga na Yoane ta ndako e Simo ko Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Bokiyo bo Simo adaka asambi ta bokaki, tengasa apekaka na pɛpɛlɛ; mbala emɔti bapaka Yesu gala tine e nde. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu abatamaka mbuti na nde, amopeaka ta ebɔ ko amangɔdjɔkɔ; pɛpɛlɛ esiaka na nde na bea asapaka tine bobakɔmedja.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Yana aimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, ngɔngɔ ibosama bo modakabusa, balwɛkɛ Yesu bato ba bipeko ko na bia ibadaka na miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bato basusu ba ibonga badaka baboli ta boso bo ekukɛ e ndako. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu aheledjaka bato banɛnɛ ba bipeko, ibadaka na biego tungu na tungu. Abenganaka miembo mibe minɛnɛ, aipaka miembo mibe ndjea e bobala, tengasa amidjebaka.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akɛi ta Galilea</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4, 42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ehuma na hindihindi, angɔkɔ ko aimaka akɛkɛ ta etengelenge oho tine bongɔnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simo engbanga na binande bamohombaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ehole emoenɛbo, babalaka na nde: «Bato basusu bohombaka.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Endolo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Lokɛni ta pamba ekina, ta mabonga ma mbuti mbuti. Na bea natungi nalehe Bwɛndi Bopele pongono oho, tengasa edi tina edua mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Ko na bea, akɛkɛ ta ibonga i Galilea isusu; alehaka Bwɛndi Bopele ta sinagoga i bobo ko abenganaka miembo mibe.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto o mabha</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Moto omɔti o mabha aduaka adi Yesu, akwaka magbundɔ ko amongɔnɔkɔ: «Okapala, oboani bosɛnodjani!» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu amokeaka ndjokwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amokeya ndjokwa </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Aluma na kɛlɛ na nde.</char></note>; aninodjaka ebɔ, amobɛndjɛkɛ ko abalaka: «Napali, sɛnoa!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Na mbala emɔti, mabha masiaka na momi omina ko asɛnoaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Na mbala emɔti, Yesu amoyanedjaka, amosiaka; <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Ko abalaka na nde: «Pɛ botɔndea moto, endolo kɛ asinedje adi nganga o Ndjakomba ko pa ikabo tine bosɛnoa bo wɛ elenge ekoma Mose, adake tati ta tina e bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 14, 2-32.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Endolo yo, ta iyane i nde abalaka gala emina ta bisika bisusu, midjɔ mi moimeaka. Na tina emina, Yesu aibɔngɔkɔ bosinedja ta mabonga manɛnɛ; adikamaka sokolu ta etengelenge ko na bea bato baduaka adi yo.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moto ondɔ mako</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ngɔngɔ ibaasu, Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ ta ibonga i Kapalanauma, bato baokaka boo adi ta ndako. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Emumu e bato baputoanaka ena, na bea polo eidaka nongo ta ekukɛ e ndako ko Yesu abalehaka Bwɛndi Bopele. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Baduaka na momi ondɔ mako mosongamake na bami banɛi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Elenge adakabo pɛ bodia ndjea e boimea adi Yesu, tine emumu e bato. Bakundoaka ndonga e ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bakundoaka ndonga e ndako </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ndonga e ndako ekɔmɔkɔ na mele ko na kpɔtɔ.</char></note> ta polo edaka Yesu; ta ipose itɔ bo, batitedjaka momi ondɔ mako na bokaki ibosamaka yo. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu bodima bo bobo, abalaka na etumbɛ: «Mwana o mbi, mabe ma wɛ mayɛmi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Edaka ta polo emina, ekenge e balehi ba mobeko badaka balɛdjɛ ta milema: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Tina ndani abali bea? Asingi Ndjakomba. Oboani boyɛ mabe nda? Tengasa oko Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asingaka Ndjakomba </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 24, 16 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Oko Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 103, 3; Isa 43, 25.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu adjebaka na mbala emɔti ta mwembo mo nde, malɛno ma bobo. Abalaka na bu: «Tina ndani odini na malɛno mia? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Edi na bopɛpɛtɛ mɛnɛ bobala na etumbɛ boo: “Mabe ma wɛ mayɛmi”; kaoko: “Angɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko dala”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Na bea bɛngi odjebeni boo Mwana o Moto adi na kpatsi tine boyɛ mabe ta kpɔtɔ.» Abalaka na etumbɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Nabali na wɛ, angɔ, tomba bokaki bo wɛ ko yana ta ndako e wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Momi omina asangɔdjɔkɔ, mbala emɔti atombi bokaki bo nde ko aemai ta boso bo bato basusu. Bato bakamoaka ko bakumedjaka Ndjakomba. Babalaka: «Loipakenɛ imu modjɔ boso!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abei Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ naikina ta mokula mo ibeke i ibonga i Galilea. Emumu e bato eduaka adi yo ko adaka abaheledja. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ta bonɔ, aenɛkɛ Lewi, mwana o Alipe, adi ta bilo ekaputedje bo puti. Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kimanani!» Lewi angɔkɔ ko amokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Ehole edaka yo ayaka ta ndako e Lewi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi ma gɛlɛki mabalaka oto ndako. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endolo edaka mɛnɛ ndako e Lewi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Te ndako e Yesu. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 5, 29.</char></note>, baputedji ba puti na bato babe badaka ta mesa engbanga na Yesu na batingami ba nde, tengasa edaka na emumu e bato bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Yana balehi ba mobeko na bapalusai bamoenɛkɛ adaka aya na baputedji ba puti ko na bato babe, babalaka na batingami ba nde: «Tina ndani ayaka na baputedji ba puti ko na bato babe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta molɔngɔ mo 15-16 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ko ta Luk 15, 1-2.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu abaokaka ko abalaka: «Editi na tina e bato ba mikuku mipele te bahombe monganga, endolo bato ba bipeko te bohombaka monganga. Naidua tine bato ba bodjo, endolo adi bato babe.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali tine bokia mia</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Batingami ba Yoane na bapalusai bokiaka mia. Busa bomɔti baduaka bomohɔdjɔ: «Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ te bakie mia, endolo batingami ba Yoane na batingami ba bapalusai bokiaka mia?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Denga i momi babwani bokia mia ehole edi momi engbanga na bu? Ehole edi momi na bu polo emɔti babwaniti bokia mia. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Endolo masu maduabi bakabakatoabi momi na bea bakiabi mia busa bomina. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Moto atatonga epasa e esendja eyanie ta esendja eyou; ekada bea, esendja eyanie alake epasa e esendja eyou ko ipose lanɛngɛke naikina. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ko moto ataisa mana mayanie ta mbola iyou; ekada bea, mana mabatodjake mbola: mana mabehake na mbola pongono. Endolo tebeya! Tine mana mayanie, etungi na mbola iyanie!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ko sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ta busa bo sabata, Yesu akatisaka gbie e bule. Batingami ba nde badaka babuka migbɔndu mi mbuma i bule na ndjea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bapalusai babalaka na Yesu: «Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ bakɔkɔ eka esiami ta busa bo sabata?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">34, 2</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Oilangani eka ekɔ Dapiti, ta ehole edaka yo na posa eboyaka ko eokayo ndja, yo na bato ibadaka na nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Akweaka engbanga na bato ba nde ta ndako e Ndjakomba, ehole edaka nganga monɛnɛ Abiatala, ayaka miɛmbɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayaka miɛmbɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 21, 2-7 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Abiatala </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 15, 35 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Imibondjeaka bo Ndjakomba </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 24, 9.</char></note> imi bondjeaka bo Ndjakomba, yo na bato ba nde; na bea edaka oko na banganga ba Ndjakomba bomayaka.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Ko Yesu abalaka na bu pongono: «Sabata ekɔmɔ tine moto; ko moto aikɔmɔ tine Sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Na tina emina, mwana o moto adi Kumu o sabata.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto ta busa bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Ngɔngɔ, Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ ta sinagoga. Edaka ena momi omɔti na ebɔ eondɔke. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bapalusai bakokoledjaka Yesu mɛnɛ kaoko aboani boheledja moto ta busa bo sabata, bɛngi bamopunde. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na momi odaka na ebɔ eondɔke: «Angɔ, emaya, ta ndanda e bato.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Ngɔngimina abalaka na bu: «Edimama bokɔ ta busa bo sabata nde? Bokɔ bopele kaoko bokɔ bobe, boheledja kaoko bowa?» Endolo bapɔpɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Na bea Yesu abaendjaka na miso ma kɛlɛ; aoka ndjokwa mɛnɛ tine badaka na milema mipipo. Abalaka na momi: «Ninodja ebɔ e wɛ.» Aeninodjaka ko ebɔ emina ehela! <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bapalusai baimaka ko baputoanaka ta ikita na bato ba Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baputoanaka ikita na bato ba Elode </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bato bamina badaka bato ba pamba e Elode Atipasi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Boso bo Yesu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mbunoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngɔngɔ i Yesu. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bahombaka boenɛ omoti o batitani bakumu Elode e suku adaka gupɛnɛlɛ o Loma.</char></note>, bɛngi bahombe enɔli ebowa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emumu e bato badoi adi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu adongaka ta pamba e ibeke engbanga na batingami ba nde. Emumu e bato emokimanaka donga ta ibonga i Galilea, e Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />e Yelusalɛmɛ, e Idume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Idume: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngando emina edaka ta pamba e sude e yudea ko edaka ta ibonga enɛnɛ e Ebone.</char></note>, ibonga ikina idaka ta pamba e duwa e Yolodane ko mbuti na Tula na Sidona. Emumu e bato baokaka misusu mikɔkɔ Yesu, baduaka adi yo. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde boo bamobɔngedje bwato, tine bato basaka mombambamedja. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Elenge adakayo aheledja bato banɛnɛ, bato ba bego basweanaka bobatama mbuti na nde, bɛngi bamobɛndje. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ko miembo mibe, ehole emoenɛkɛ bo mikwaka ta boso bo nde ko migamaka: «Wɛ odi mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Endolo Yesu amigameaka na bopipo mɛnɛ misaka bala ta tina e nde.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔi bapɔsɔlu domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ngɔngimina Yesu aiweaka ta ikoli, abeaka bato ibapalaka yo; na bea baduaka adi yo. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ahɔkɔ bato domi na babae, ababakeaka kombe e bapɔsɔlu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta makomi makina maditi na kombe yena </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bapɔsɔlu.</char></note>. Abahɔkɔ bɛngi badae na nde engbanga ko bobaloma boleha Bwɛndi Bopele, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kpatsi e bobenganaka miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ahɔkɔ bapɔsɔlu domi na babae: Simo obakeaka yo kombe Piɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe e piɛlɛ: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Mat 16, 16-18; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Yoa 1, 42.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Djake na mwange e nde Yoane, bo basusu babae bana ba Djebede. Yesu ababakeaka kombe Boanɛlɛgɛsi, etingodji: «Bana ba bɛi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 9, 54.</char></note>», <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Pilipo, Batelemi, Matayo, Toma; Djake, mwana o Alipe; Tade, Simo okaswe ibonga; <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ko Yudasi Isikaliota yona okabaka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asɔmbedji tina e pundi e nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12, 22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12, 10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ naikina ta ndako. Na bea emumu e bato baputoanaka ena ko Yesu na batingami ba nde baidiaka nongo enɔli e boya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ehole eoka ibota i nde gala emina, bakɛ bɛngi bamotombe, tengasa babalaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Babalaka </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Babalaka.</char></note>: «Molo mo nde motasalaka bopele!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Balehi ba mobeko ibadongaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ babalaka: «Adi na mwembo mo Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bɛlɛdjɛbulɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 10, 25 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note> atei e nde!» Ko naikina: «Kumu o miembo mibe amopi kpatsi e bobengana miembo mibe!»<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Na bea Yesu ababeaka ko abalaka na bu na masɛ: Satana abwani asabengane yo mɛnɛ? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ekada bokumu bokasakabana ta tei ebu, bokumu bomina bobwaniti boyeyoa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ekada bato ba ndako emɔti bakasakabana bo bɛnɛ, ndako emina ebwaniti boyeyoa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ekada Satana yo mɛnɛ asinedjaka ko asakabani, abwaniti boema: mosi na nde, aimei ta suka. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Moto abwaniti akwee ta ndako e moto o ngulu ko aibe bodieli bo nde, boso mɛnɛ anangake moto ongulu mbɔti; na bea ngɔngimina aibake losusu lodi ta ndako e nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Soti na bali na nu: mabe kaoko masingi masusu masingaka bo Ndjakomba, mayɛmɛbi adi bana ba bato. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Endolo yona asingaka Mwembo Mosɛnɔke atadiabi boyɛmɛ: adikabi na lindo tine seko.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu abalaka na bu bea, tine babalaka na nde: «Adi na mwembo mobe.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibota ipele i Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nange e Yesu ko na bange i nde baimeaka; badaka sokolu ko balomaka moto bomobea. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Emumu e bato edaka emohiki. Bamotɔndeaka: «Oka, nange e wɛ, bange i wɛ, ko bangɛnɛ i wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta makomi makina maditi na kombe </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ko miditi na kombe e ngɛnɛ. </char></note>, badi sokolu bohombaka.»<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Nange e mbi ko bange i mbi ba nda?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Ngɔngɔ aengɛngɛnedji miso, abalaka: «Endjani, nange e mbi ko bange i mbi ibi! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Tengasa yona akɔkɔ bopala bo Ndjakomba yo adi mwange e mbi, ngɛnɛ e mbi kaoko nange e mbi.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mooneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ boleha ta mokula mo ibeke. Emumu e bato eduaka amohika, na tina emina akweaka ta bwato ko asadedjaka. Emumu e bato edaka o ngondo mbuti na ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Abalehaka ekoka mɛnɛ na masɛ. Endja midjɔ mibalaka yo na bu ta bileho bi nde: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Hokamedjani! Busa bomɔti, moneli akɛkɛ ta gbie e nde tine bona. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Enakobea ehole edaka yo amɛsɛ mbuma, ikina ikwaka ta yɔngɔ e ndjea; na bea mbulu baduaka ko badjikomaka. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Ekenge ekina e mbuma ekwaka ta polo e mabanga, yana mokpɔtɔ moidaka motutu. Mbuma ikandoi pɛpɛlɛ tine mokpɔtɔ moidaka motutu. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Endolo ehole eimaka moi, mokakanedjaka kona imina: tine djidaka na nginga. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Ikina mbuma ikwaka ta polo e ndjubɛ. Ndjubɛ ikandoaka, imbambamedjaka ko ibotaka mbuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Endolo ekenge ekina e mbuma ekwaka ta mokpɔtɔ mopele; kona itɔkɔ, ikandoaka ko ibotaka mingbɔndu: ikina ibotaka tuku isato, ikina tuku isamano, ikina mokama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Ko Yesu abalaka: «Odi na matoi ma booka, aoke!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tina ndani Yesu akapale seko bobala na masɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Ehole edikaka Yesu yo mɛnɛ, ibalamaka bomokimana na batingami domi na babae bamohɔdjɔkɔ tine masɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: Adi no odiani mbombi e bokumu bo Ndjakomba; endolo adi bia ba sokolu, misusu mikabalame oko na masɛ; <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />tine boo nongo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">«baendjaka, bataenɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">baokaka, batadjebaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">esakada boo basɔmbe adi Ndjakomba ko Ndjakomba abayɛbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 6, 9-10, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Elangama ngɔngɔ i makomi ma gɛlɛki.</char></note>!»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atingodji isɛ i moneli</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na bu: «Otasipwoakani isɛ di? Na bea obwanini bosipoa masɛ makina bo? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Moneli aonaka mobalo mo Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Bato bakina badi elenge kona eonami ta yɔngɔ e ndjea, edi polo ekwi mobalo: ehole emoki bo, satana adoi akatoa mobalo momina amilema mi bobo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bato bakina badi elenge kona eonami ta polo e mabanga: ehole eoki bo mobalo, bamoasɔi na mongandi. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Endolo baditi na nginga ta tei e bobo, bakaite oko mo ehole mokɛkɛ. Ko ehole edoi minɔngɔ na saya ta tine e mobalo, bakini edimeli. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bato bakina badi elenge kona eonami ta polo e ndjubɛ: edi bia baoka mobalo, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />endolo makɛsɛdji ma ngondo, na ekoseakosea e madieli ko na posa djikina, djabedjaka mobalo ko motaki bobota. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bato bakina badi elenge kona eonami ta kpɔtɔ ipele: edi bia baokaka mobalo, bamoasɔi ko moboti mbuma, okina tuku isato, okina tuku isamano ko okina mokama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i molinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8, 16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Moto abwani bodua na molinda tine bomoisa ta katini kaoko ta nase i esambe? Editi bomosɛpea ta esɛpei e molinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Mat 5, 15; </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Luk 11, 33.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Tengasa misusu i mibolama mienɛmɛbi ta bhuda, ko misusu mi mbombi mienɛmɛbi bohu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Moto odi na matoi ma booka, aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Tomadani na edinga na midjɔ mokakano! Oko na mwɛngi mua moengɛkɛ na wɛ, boengɛbi oko moda momina; ko baobakeabi naikina tina e wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjakomba adi na mwɛngi tine wɛ naikina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta ikomi ikina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ndjakomba aosambedjake na mwɛngi mua masambedjaka wɛ bakina, na bonɔ mɛnɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Tengasa yona odi na moeka bamopabi lonɛnɛ; endolo yona odi pɛ boda naeka, bamokatoabi moeka odaki na nde.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ ikona ekatɔe yo mɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bobwani na moda mu: Moto omɔti amɛsɛkɛ mbuma ta mokpɔtɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ngɔngimina, na yo ahwɛ bulu bosusu na adɛe pɛ bohwɛ, kona djatɔkɔ ko djakandoaka, atadjebaka nongo eka anɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Mokpɔtɔ mo mɛnɛ motɔedji mbuma: mbangi ndjani, ngɔngɔ mongbɔndu, mbunoko mbuma i bule ilumi ta mongbɔndu. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ko ehole epingi mbuma, moto asaisa ta mosala na mbɛli e nde, tengasa ehole e bobuka eimei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Yoe 4, 13.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mbuma e motade</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu abalaka naikina: «Lobwani bokokanedja Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na ye? Na isɛ nda? Ibwani so lobale? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Edi elenge mbuma e motade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi mole mo ndjuwa ekabote ta ngondo e Bayuda. Mbuma emina ekadɛɛ ekɛkɛ mɛnɛ ta boendja na miso. Endolo ekabote mole mo ndjuwa mokaime monɛnɛ ko na boyai bodiko bonɔ mbuti na mɛtɛlɛ isato. A ibonga e biso edi elenge mo ndjuwa mo mesekulu ta boendja na miso</char></note>; ehole eoni bo ta kpɔtɔ, edi mbuma enɔi na bokɛkɛ mɛnɛ ta mbuma djisusu i ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Endolo ta boona, ekandoi ko eimei kona enɛnɛ bonɔ kona isusu i ndjuwa i gbie. Ekandodji tape djinɛnɛ ibwani na mbulu ba busa botonga mopo ma bobo nase i esi.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Na bea, edi na masɛ manɛnɛ imadaka yo abaleha mobalo mo Ndjakomba, bobwana na bosipoa bo bobo. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Abalaka na bu oko na masɛ; endolo akadika yo mɛnɛ na batingami, abatingodjeaka midjɔ misusu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu asi lungu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mɔmɔkɔ mo busa bomina, abalaka na bu: «Lomeleni ta mokula mo ibeke.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ngɔngɔ iboyanedja emumu e bato; batingami batiteaka ta bwato. Edaka yana pongono mato makina mbuti na nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Gbundumo, lungu epipo mɛnɛ ebangaka bokumba, bibuku bi madiba bikweaka ta bwato mbunoko bolumaka na madiba. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Ta ehole emina, Yesu ahwɛkɛ ta mbaka e bwato e sangɔngɔ, molo mobaki ta monyuku. Batingami ba nde bamosisodjaka ko bagamaka: «Molehi logwi! Etobaleaka nongo eka emɔti?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu asisoaka, agameaka lungu ko abalaka na ibeke: «Bogo! Pɔpɔnɔ!» Na bea lungu ekinaka bokumba ko losusu lopɔpɔnɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Tina ndani wabangakani? Oditini na bodima?»<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Endolo batingami badaka na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ ko basabaleanaka: «Iyo moto nda, bɛngi lungu na mbonge losusu lomosume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokokanedja ta Ndj 65, 8;89, 10;107, 23-32.</char></note>?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu aheledji moto odaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Baimeaka ta mokula mokina mo ibeke ta ibonga enɛnɛ i Galilea, ta ibonga i bato ba Gelasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal alɛdjɛkɛ iya ibonga edi ta pamba ekime moyi ta pamba e ibeke Gelasa kaoko i Galilea. Kokanedja ta Mat 8.28 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ehole eduboaka Yesu ta bwato, momi omɔti aimaka ta ndanda e makila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makila </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Madaka mabɔngedjamake ta mabanga.</char></note>, adaka na mwembo mobe, aduaka ta boso bo nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Adaka adi ta makila, pɛ moto odaka na ngulu e bomonanga mbɔti, nongo na sɛni; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />tengasa adaka mbala inɛnɛ monangake mɔmɔ na mako na sɛni, endolo yo adaka bolena sɛni ko na botswa mbɔti: pɛ moto odaka na ngulu e bomogɔledja. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Adaka mbala inɛnɛ ta makila, bolebaleba bulu na moi ta makoli, bogamakaka ko bosabenedjakaka na mabanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ehole enɛkɛ yo Yesu bohali, apotaka, akwaka mangbundɔ ta boso bo nde <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />ko agamaka na ngulu mɛnɛ: «Tina ndani okwei ta midjɔ mi mbi, Yesu Mwana o Ndjakomba odi odiko i losusu? Nongɔni, ta kombe e Ndjakomba, pɛ boyekeani!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Tengasa Yesu abalaka na nde: «Ima adi momi yo mwembo mobe!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Kombe e wɛ nda?» Amosɔmbedjaka: «Kombe e mbi “banɛnɛ”, tengasa lodi banɛnɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Ko amongɔnɔkɔ mɛnɛ boo adae pɛ bomiloma ta sokolu e ibonga. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Enakobea edaka oho mbuti na ikoli bwela bo ngulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta malɛi ma Lew 11, 7 ko Det 14, 8, na </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngulu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Epeamaka na Bayuda tine </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bosia boyaka. Etingodjaka boo lodi ta ibonga edi pɛ boda Bayuda.</char></note> bonɛnɛ bodaka bayaka. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Miembo mibe miongɔnɔkɔ Yesu: «Loloma ta ngulu biya ho, lokwe ta tei ibu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu abapaka enɔli. Miembo mibe mimaka mikweaka ta ngulu. Bwela bo ngulu bosusu, bodaka mbuti na koto ibae, bopotaka engbanga ko bodindaka ta ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Babanei ba ngulu bayanaka bapote ko batɔndɔkɔ gala emina ta ibonga inɛnɛnɛ ko na mabonga masusu ma mbuti mbuti. Na bea bato baduaka aendja modjɔ imosanɔmɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ehole eimeaka bo mbuti na Yesu ko baenɛkɛ momi odaka na miembo mibe adi, alwaka bisendja ko asɔmbedjaka yongi e moto. Na bea, balumaka na bɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Bato ibaenɛkɛ meako mimina, babatɔndeaka isolo inɔmɔkɔ adi moto yona odaka na miembo mibe ko na i bwela bo ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Na bea bongɔnɔkɔ Yesu boo adonge ta ibonga i bobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Oko ta ehole yena etiteaka Yesu ta bwato, moto ohelaka na miembo mibe amongɔnɔkɔ boo akɛ na nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu aimopa enɔli, endolo abalaka na nde: «Yana ta ibota i wɛ, ta ibota i wɛ ko tɔndɔ meako misusu miokɔmei Kumu ko moda mokei yo ndjokwa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Moto omina ayanaka ko aimeaka botɔndɔ meako misusu mimokɔmeaka Yesu ta ibonga i Dekapolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapolo edaka iputo i ibonga domi te i Bayuda. Idaka ta dɔngɔ ikina i ngunda e dua e Yolodane.</char></note> meako misusu mimokɔmeaka Yesu; ko bato basusu bakamoaka.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana mwali o Yailo ko mwali obɛndjɛ esendja e Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ta ehole esɔmbɔkɔ Yesu ta dɔngɔ ikina i ibeke. Ko emumu e bato baputoanaka mbuti na nde, adaka adi ta bwato ta mokula mo ibeke. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mokondji o sinagoga kombe e nde Yailo, aimeaka. Ehole enɛ yo Yesu, akwaka magbundɔ ta mako ma nde <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />ko amongɔnɔkɔ mɛnɛ: «Mwana o mbi mwali adi mbuti na bogwa, nongɔni, dua amobake mɔmɔ bɛngi ahele!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yesu akɛ na nde. Emumu e bato emokimanaka ko bamombambamedjaka pamba isusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Enakobea, mwali omɔti odaka na yogo e botanga makia bianga domi na ibae. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Aenɛkɛ saya enɛnɛ adi minganga, ko abedjaka bodieli bo nde bosusu ko aihelaka. Endolo yogo e nde enɛngɛkɛ oko bonɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Aokaka babala tine gala e Yesu. Akweaka ta emumu e bato, ta sangɔngɔ i Yesu, ko abɛndjɛkɛ esendja e nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tengasa asabaleaka: «Nakapea nongo bisendja bi nde, nabwani bohela!» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Na mbala emɔti makia makinaka botanga ta mokuku mo nde ko adjeba boo aheli na yogo e nde.<verse eid="MRK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Oko ta ehole emina, Yesu adjeba boo ngulu eimi ta tei e nde. Ahombanaka ta emumu e bato ko ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Opei bisendja bi mbi nda?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Batingami ba nde bamosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛnɛkɛ emumu e bato bombambamedji pamba isusu, ko wahɔdjɔkɔ naikina: “Opeini nda?” » <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Endolo Yesu adaka oko aendja, bɛngi adjebe moto okɔi modjɔ momina. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Elenge mwali omina adjebaka yo modjɔ mosakɔmɔ na nde, adjoaka na bɔɔ bosadumba mangbundɔ ta mako ma Yesu ko abalaka na nde soti esusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Mwana o mbi mwali, bodima bo wɛ boheledji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boheledji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Boheledji.</char></note>. Kɛɛ na bogo, ko oheli na yogo e wɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Oko ta ehole edaka Yesu abala, bato badongaka ta ndako e mokondji o sinagoga ko bamotɔndeaka: «Mwana o wɛ agwi! Tina ebotungea naikina Molehi editi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Endolo Yesu aisa nongo malɛi ta mibalo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisa nongo malɛi ta mibalo mi bobo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina aokaka mibalo mi bobo.</char></note> mi bobo ko abalaka na mokondji o sinagoga: «Pɛ bobanga, dima oko bodima.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Aipalaka moto amokimane, dongedja oko Piɛlɛ, Djake na Yoane, mwange e nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ehole eimeaka bo adi mokondji o sinagoga, Yesu ataneaka bato badaka bayea ko balɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Akweaka ta ndako ko abala na bu: «Tina eboyegebana ko na biyo nda? Mwana agwiti, ahwɛli.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Na bea bato basɛkɛkɛ Yesu. Endolo yo aimedjaka bato basusu sokolu, atombaka oko sange e mwana, nange e mwana ko batingami ba nde basato; na bea akweaka ta ekenge e ndako edaka mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Apeaka mwana ta ebɔ ko abalaka na nde: «Talita kumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Talita kumi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe ibae i alameyɛ; alameyɛ edaka kɔpi ebalamaka na Bayuda ta ehole e Yesu.</char></note>!» Etingodji: «Nabali na wɛ mwana mwali, angɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Mbala emɔti, mwana mwali angɔi ko aimeaka bodala. Adaka na bianga domi na ibae. Bato baimeaka na bokamoa bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Endolo Yesu abasiaka mɛnɛ badae pɛ botɔndea nongo moto. Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bu: «Mopani mia ayake.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Bato ba Nadjaleta te badime Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu adongaka ta ndako yena, akɛkɛ ta ibonga ikandoaka yo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngando enɛnɛ... </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Nasaleta. Kokanedja ta Mat 13, 54 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>; batingami ba nde bamokimanaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ehole eimeaka busa bo sabata, Yesu abangaka boleha ta sinagoga. Na bea emumu e bato ibamohokamedjaka bakamoaka. Babalaka: «Adihi yo meako imi djɔ? Omopi bowɛi bu nda? Adihi yo sueya e bokɔ bimbete bi bokamoa djɔ? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Iyo te sapate? Iyo te mwana o Malia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 6, 42. </char></note>? Iyo te mwange Djake, Djose, Yuda ko na Simo? Ko bangɛnɛ i nde loditi na bu iya?» Ko na bea ebasiaka badae pɛ bomodimea. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mbaeli o Ndjakomba bokumaka polo djisusu, dongedja oko ta ibonga i nde, ta pako e nde ko ta ndako e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 4, 24, Yoa 4, 44.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Aibɔngɔkɔ bokɔ oho embete e bokamoa; dongedja oko bobabakea mɔmɔ na boheledja ekenge e bato ba bipeko. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Akamoaka mɛnɛ na taka e bodima e bato ba ibonga i nde.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Elomu e bapɔsɔlu domi na babae</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu akɛkɛ ta mabonga masusu ma mbuti mbuti tine boleha. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Abeaka ba batingami ba nde domi na babae ko abalomaka babae babae, abapaka kpatsi ta diko i miembo mibe. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Abalehaka boo: «Pɛ botombani eka emɔti tine mɔndɔ, dongedja oko pango; pɛ botombani mwɛmbɛ, pɛ tɔmbi, pɛ pata e palanga ta misenge mi bino. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lwani sapato, endolo pɛ botombani kasaka ibae.» <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Abalaka na bu naikina: «Ekadabo oimeini ta ibonga imɔti, bea bakopani ndako, dikamani yana mbunoko ehole akinake no ibonga imina. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Endolo ekada bato ba ibonga imɔti bakalona boasɔni kaoko pɛ bokeani, dongani ena ko bhubholani dhutu ibigbota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bhubholani dhutu i bigbota </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edi embete e elone. Kokanedja ta Bik 13, 51; 18, 6.</char></note> bi bino: adake tine bobo embete e elone.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Batingami bakɛkɛ ko balehaka bato basusu basɔmbɔtɔne milema. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Babenganaka miembo mibe minɛnɛ ko baheledjaka bato ba bipeko na bobasuowa munɛ ta molo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Dja 5, 14.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elode ko Yoane Mobatisi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Na bea, mokondji Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elode etingodji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Elode Atipasa, odaka kumu ta Galilea.</char></note> aokaka babala gala e Yesu, tengasa kombe e nde eokamaka mɔngɔ masusu. Bakina badaka babala: «Edi Yoane yona oinaka apusoi ta ndanda e bago! Na tina emina adi na sueya e bokɔ ngindola.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bakina pongono badaka babala: «Adi Elia.» Bakina pongono badaka babala: «Adi mbaeli o Ndjakomba elenge omɔti o ba mbaeli ba nde.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Endolo Elode aokaka misusu mibalamaka, adaka bosabalea: «Edi Yoane Mobatisi, yona olenedjaka mbi molo, apusoi!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Tengasa, Elode yo mɛnɛ apedjaka Yoane, amonangedjaka na sɛni ko amoisedjaka ta bɔlɔkɔ; tine Elodiade, mwali o Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pilipo etingodji Elode Pilipo, ohelamaka ta Loma; ta ehole e Sedjale pilipo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 8, 27</char></note>, mwange e nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Tengasa Yoane abalaka na Elode: «Etungi na wɛ boasɔ mwali o mwange e wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Lew 18, 16; 20, 21.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade alumaka na swɛ na Yoane ko ahombaka amowoe, endolo aidiaka enɔeli; <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Tengasa Elode adaka na bɔɔ na Yoane. Adjebaka boo adi moto o bodjo ko mosɛnɔke, na tina emina amobaneaka. Ehole emokeaka yo, adaka moyekamake ta malɛi; endolo nongo bea apalaka oko bomohokamedja. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Enakobea, enɔeli epele eimeaka adi Elodiade ta busa bo tɛkɛ e bobotama bo Elode. Yo abɔngedjaka tɛkɛ enɛnɛ, abeaka bato ba ekumu, bakondji ba basoda ko bakondji ba ibonga i Galilea. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana mwali Elodiade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwana mwali Elodiade </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi makina madi na </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mwana nde mwali Elodiade.</char></note> akweaka ta ndako e tɛkɛ ko abuaka; na bea asepedjaka Elode ko bato ibabeaka yo. Mokondji abalaka na moseka mwali: «Hɔdjɔni eka apalaka wɛ, ko nopake.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Amobhɛleaka bhɛli ta miso ma bato: «Nabhɛli boo nopake eka esusu ahɔdjɔkeni wɛ, nongo ndanda e bokumu bo mbi.»<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Moseka mwali aimaka ko ahɔdjɔkɔ ilako adi nange e nde: «Eboani mbi bomosɛngɛ nde?» Nange e nde asɔmbedjaka: «Mosɛngɛ molo mo Yoane yona oinaka.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mwana mwali apotaka, asɔmbɔkɔ adi mokondji ko amosɛngɛkɛ: «Napali opɛni edɛdi mɛnɛ molo mo Yoane oinaka ta saani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mokondji aimeaka na ndjokwa; aibɔngɔkɔ bomodjima esɛngɛ e nde, tine amobhɛleaka bhɛli ta miso ma bato. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Mokondji alomaka pɛpɛlɛ soda omɔti okamobane, amolwɛ molo mo Yoane. Soda omina akɛkɛ ta bɔlɔkɔ ko alenaka molo mo Yoane. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ahulaka na molo mo mina ta sani ko amopaka adi mwana mwali; yo ta mbala e nde, amopaka adi nange e nde ta saani. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Ehole eokaka batingami ba Yoane gala emina, bakɛkɛ atomba mokuku mo nde ko bamopuseaka ta ikila.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayakedji bami koto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoa 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bapɔsɔlu bahulaka mbuti na Yesu ko bamotɔndeaka meako misusu imikɔkɔ bo ko milehaka bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Abalaka na bu: «Duani ta etengelenge ko hemani mwɛka.» Tengasa bato banɛnɛ badaka badua ko bayana, baidiaka nongo ehole e boyaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Batiteaka ta bwato ko bakɛ ta etengelenge. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Endolo emumu e bato babenɛkɛ bakɛ ko badjebaka dɔngɔ ikɛkɛ bo. Na bea badalaka mɔndɔ mopipo na mako, donga ta ibonga isusu, ko baimeaka boso bo Yesu na batingami ba nde ta polo ekɛkɛ bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Ehole eduboaka Yesu ta bwato, aenɛkɛ emumu e bato; molema mo nde molumaka na ndjokwa, tine bato bamina badaka elenge bhata bataki mobanei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mit 27, 17; 1Mok 22, 17; Edj 34, 5-6.</char></note>. Ko abalehaka meako minɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Elenge ehole esiaka, batingami babatamaka mbuti na Yesu ko babalaka na nde: «Ehole esi ko polo ye ediso edi etengelenge. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Yanedja bato bɛngi bakɛ ta ibonga i mbuti na ta gbie, bɛngi badie eka eboyaka.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Bapani ino bɛnɛ mia ma boyaka.» Endolo bo babalaka na nde: «Lokɛ asomba mwɛmbɛ na pata i bibende<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata e palanga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ainedjaka ta ehole eyou iputo li engi busa li mosali o gbie. Endja pongono ta Mat 20, 2.</char></note> mikama mibae tine bobayakedja?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Odini na miɛmbɛ meka? Kɛni aendjeni.» Ngɔngɔ i boendja, basɔmbedjaka: «Lodi na miɛmbɛ mitano na swi babae.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Na bea, Yesu abalaka na batingami boo dedjani bato bibole bibole ta ndjani. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bato badaka badi bibole mokama ko bakina bibole tuku itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu atombaka miɛmbɛ mitano na swi babae, angɔdjɔkɔ miso ta busa ko abalaka kɔpi e bodjongoa. Abukaka miɛmbɛ ko amipaka adi batingami boo bakabane na bato. Bakabanaka pongono swi babae adi bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bato basusu bayaka ko bagolaka; <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Na bea batingami bandoaka bikengakengi bi miɛmbɛ na bi swi ibidikaka: balumedjaka mitinga domi na ibae<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Bak 4, 42-44.</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 2 Mik 4, 42-44.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Bami ibayaka miɛmbɛ badaka koto itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adali diko i madiba</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoa 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde batitee ta bwato bɛngi banɔe boso bo nde ta mokula mokina mo ibeke, ta ibonga inɛnɛ i Betesaida, ta ehole edaka yo ayanedja bato. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ngɔngɔ iboyanedja bato, Yesu akɛkɛ ta ikoli tine bongɔnɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Ehole emɔmɔkɔ, bwato boimeaka ta ndanda e ibeke ko Yesu adikaka yo mɛnɛ o ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Aenɛkɛ batingami badaka na ibunga iboluka, tengasa lungu edaka epipo. Na bea, ta eye busa, Yesu abakimanaka adale diko i madiba, ko apalaka abanɔe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bobanɔ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Botanea.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ehole emoɛnɛkɛ bo adale diko i madiba, balɛdjɛkɛ edaka elima ko baimeaka bolɛbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Tengasa, bamoenɛkɛ bo basusu ko baokaka mongangale. Endolo na mbala emɔti, Yesu abalaka na bu: «Sapingedjani! Edi mbi; pɛ bobangani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Ngɔngɔ atiteaka na bu ta bwato, ko lungu esiaka. Batingami balumaka na bokamoa mɛnɛ; <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Tengasa baisipoaka ngindola e miɛmbɛ: tine boo malɛno ma bobo maimeaka modidi.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji bato ba bipeko ta ibonga i Genesaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ngɔngɔ i bokatisa ibeke, baimeaka ta ngando e Gelesa. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ta boduboa bo bobo ta bwato, bato basipoaka Yesu na mbala emɔti. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bapotaka donga ta ibonga imina isusu ko baduaka na bato ba bipeko babasonge na makaki, ta polo isusu iokaka bo Yesu adi ena. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Polo isusu ikweaka Yesu, edae ta mabonga makɛkɛkɛ ko ta mabonga manɛnɛnɛ ko ta gbie, bato badaka basonge bato ba bipeko na makaki ta polo i bhuda; ko bamongɔnɔkɔ boo babɛndje nongo molenda mo esendja e nde. Ibea bato basusu ibamobɛndjɛkɛ bahelaka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ko bileho bikina bakɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko bahulaka ta Yelusalɛmɛ, baputoanaka mbuti na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baenɛkɛ batingami bakina bayaka mia na mɔmɔ pita, etingodji boo pɛ bososa mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Enakobea, bapalusai na basuku ba Bayuda basusu baboaniti boyaka oko basose mɔmɔ, bokimana bokɔkɔ bo bobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Luk 11, 38.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ko bakahula ta polo i bhuda, bayake boso pɛ bosasɛnodja. Bakasume bonɔ mibeko mikina mi bokɔkɔ, elenge bososa kɔbɔ, poke, masasu ma bibende [ko kiti i matala]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta makomi makina maditi na mu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Basuku ba bapalusai na balehi ba mobeko bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Tina ndani batingami ba wɛ bakayake pɛ bososa mɔmɔ, ta mwɛngi mo bokɔkɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Isaya atɔndɔkɔ bopele mɛnɛ tine bobo! Elenge ekomama tine bobo! Ndjɔ ba melo mibae, na bea mbaeli o Ndjakomba akomaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Bato bi bakakumedjeni oko na mibalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">endolo milema mi bobo bohali na mbi;<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Edi oko ngasa bakaongɔneni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">bileho bi bobo bidi oko mibeko mi bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 29, 13, elangama ta makomi mayou ma gɛlɛki.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Okahɛngeni mobeko mo Ndjakomba, okasapɛni na makɔkɔ ma bato.» <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Abalaka na bu naikina: «Okadumbeni mɛnɛ mobeko mo Ndjakomba, tine bosapa na makɔkɔ ma bino. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Tengasa Mose abalaka: “Suma sange e wɛ na nange e wɛ”, ko pongono “yona abalaka bobe na sange e nde kaoko na nange e nde atungi na bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 2, 12 ko ta Dit 5, 16; Boi 21.17 ko Lew 20.9.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Endolo ino, okabaleni: moto akabala na sange e nde kaoko na nange e nde: “Eka epalaki mbi nopɛ bɛngi eokamoe, edi Kolobani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kolobani </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kombe e alameyɛ.</char></note>” etingodji “Ikabo i Ndjakomba”. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Na bea, topakeni moto nongo enɔeli akɔe moeka tine sange e nde kaoko tine nange e nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Edi na moda mua, walonakani mobalo mo Ndjakomba tine bolongedja bokɔkɔ ibokineani bo. Ko wakɔkɔni meako minɛnɛ mikina na bokokana.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meako mikabedje moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15, 10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ngɔngɔ Yesu abeaka naikina emumu e bato ko abalaka na bu: «Hokamedjanini ko sipoani bopele: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Pɛ eka emɔti esokolu ekakwe adi moto ekamoimedje pita; endolo yena ekime adi moto, ekamoimedje pita. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[ Okani bopele, odi na matoi ma boka, aoke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta mikanda minɛnɛ miyou. </char></note>!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ehole esɔmbɔkɔ Yesu ta ndako, bohali na emumu e bato, batingami ba nde bamohɔdjɔkɔ tine e isɛ imina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Abalaka na bu: «Ino pongono otakini bowɛi? Otadjebakani eka emɔti esokolu ekwei ta tei e moto eboaniti bomoimedja pita? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Tengasa iyena ekadae pɛ bokwea ta molema mo nde, endolo ta sɔpɔ ko ekɛi aima ta ndima.» Na bea Yesu ainedjaka boo mia masusu ma boyaka madi masɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 10, 9-16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Abalaka naikina: «Edi eka ekime adi moto ekamoimedje pita. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Tengasa edi ta tei e molema mo moto, edi malɛno mabe makamolome ta bɔɔli, iba, bowa, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />bɔɔli, ndukeli, bobila, bolowa, bohelama ta wusuwusu, ikuwa, bobala bobe tina e bakina, molumba ko basadaledjaka elenge moto otaka e bowɛi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Midjɔ mia misusu mibe boimaka ta tei e moto ko bobedjaka moto.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali mokɛndɛli adimi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu adongaka ena ko akɛkɛ ta ibonga i Tula. Akweaka ta ndako emɔti ko aipalaka moto adjebe, endolo aidikaka ta mbombi. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Na bea, mwali omɔti adaka na mwana o nde mwali yona oyekeamaka na mwembo mobe. Yana amotɔndeaka bo gala e Yesu; mbala emɔti aduaka asadumba ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mwali omina adaka mogɛlɛki, o ibonga i Penisi e Sulia. Aongɔnɔkɔ Yesu boo abengane mwembo mobe adi mwana o nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kina boso bana bagole; tengasa editi bopele botomba mia ma bana ba bato ko bopa na mbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Endolo mwali omina amosɔmbedjaka: «Edi oko bea Kumu, mbwa, akayake mbumbu djikadumbe bana.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na nde: «Na tina ekɔpi yena, kɛɛ: mwembo mobe moimi adi mwana o wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ehole eyanaka yo ta ndako e nde, ataneaka mwana asambi ta esambe: mwembo mobe moimaka.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji emimi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 15:29-31">Mat 15, 29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu akinaka ibonga i Tula, anɔkɔ ta ibonga i Sidona ko aimeaka ta ibeke i Galilea, ta ndjea enɔkɔ ta ibonga i Dekapolo. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Baduaka na moto o emimi ko baongɔnɔkɔ Yesu boo amobake ebɔ adaka na kpɔkɔsɔ e bobala. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Na bea Yesu amotombaka yo mɛnɛ, mootɔtɔkɔ na bato; amoisaka sapi ta matoi, atsweaka masɔi ta sapi i nde ko apeaka yemi e emimi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ngɔngimina Yesu angɔdjɔkɔ miso ta busa, asopaka mohemano ko abalaka: «Epata!» Etingodji: «Dipoama!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Na mbala emɔti, matoi ma nde madipoamaka, ko yemi e nde etatoaka ko aimeaka bobala bopele. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu apingedjaka bato ibadaka ena boo badae pɛ botɔndea bato gala emina. Nongo adakayo abasia bobala, endolo bato badaka oko babala gala emina. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Ko bato badaka na bokamoa bonɛnɛ; babalaka: «Misusu makɔkɔ yo, mikadae seko mipele mɛnɛ! Aokedjaka nongo bato bagwa matoi ko bobaledja bimimi!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ayakedji bato koto inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15, 32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Ta masu mia, emumu e bato baputoanaka naikina mbuti na Yesu. Endolo baidaka na eka e boyaka, Yesu abeaka batingami ba nde ko abalaka na bu: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Nadi na ndjokwa na bato bi, tengasa badai na mbi masu masato ko baditi na eka eboyaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nakabayanedja pɛ boyaka, batadake na ngulu ebodala na ndjea, tengasa banɛnɛ ta ndanda e bobo badongi bohali.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Batingami ba nde bamosɔmbedjaka: «Abwaniso bodia miɛmbɛ djɔɔ, tine bobayakedja ta polo ye edi etengelenge?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Odini na miɛmbɛ meka?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Sambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Na bea, abalaka na emumu e bato badae na mobondo ta kpɔtɔ. Ngɔngɔ ibotomba miɛmbɛ sambo, akumedjaka Ndjakomba, abukaka ko amipaka na batingami ba nde, tine ba kabane na bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Badaka pongono na baaswi bakɛkɛ. Ngɔngɔ i bobala kɔpi e bodjongoa tine swi, abalaka na bu ba kabane. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Bato bayaka ko bagolaka; na bea batingami bandoaka mitinga sambo mi bikengangengi ibidikaka: <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Edaka mbuti na bato koto inɛi. Ngɔngɔ Yesu abayanedjaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Mbala emɔti Yesu atiteaka ta bwato engbanga na batingami ba nde ko bakɛkɛ ta ibonga i Dalamanuta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dalamanuta </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngando ye edjebamiti.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapalusai bahɔdji embete emɔti ebokamoa adi Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bapalusai baimeaka ko babangaka boboma kite na Yesu ebɛngi bamopike elambo. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ akɔe embete e bokamoa emɔti bodonga ta busa. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu asopaka mohemano moyai ta mwembo mo nde ko abalaka: «Tina ndani bato ba ehole ye bakahɔdje embete e bokamoa? Nabali na nu soti: okobea, pɛ nongo embete emɔti ebapametebi!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Ngɔngimina Yesu abakinaka, akweaka ta bwato ko akɛkɛ e nde ta pamba ikina ibeke.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bole bo mwɛmbɛ bo Bapalusai ko Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16, 5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Batingami babosaka botomba miɛmbɛ, badaka oko na mwɛmbɛ momɔti ta bwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu abalaka na bu etungi boo: «Odipoeni miso! Ko dani na edinga na bole bo mwɛmbɛ bo bapalusai ko na bo Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Na bea batingami badaka bobomana kitɛ ta tei e bobo, tine baidaka na miɛmbɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Adjebaka Yesu meako mi mina, abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Kitɛ abomakano tine oditini na miɛmbɛ? Mbunoko edɛdi opakiti asipoani? Odini oko na malɛi makue? Odini oko na milema mipipo? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Odini na miso, ko otaenɛkɛni? Odini na matoi, otokakani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yil 5, 21; Edj 12, 2.</char></note>? Otalɛdjɛkɛni nongo: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ehole ebukaka mbi miɛmbɛ mitano tine bato koto itano; oandoakani mitinga milumake na bikengakengi meka?» Basɔmbedjaka: «Domi na ibae.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 6, 35-44.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Ko ta ehole ebukaka mbi miɛmbɛ sambo, tine bato koto inɛi; oandoakani sanga ilumake na bikengangengi beka?» Basɔmbedjaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 8, 1-9.</char></note>: «Sambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mbunoko edɛdi, osipoakinini?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji moto ogwa miso ta Betesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Aimeaka bo ta Betesaida; baduaka adi Yesu na moto omɔti ogwa miso ko bamongɔnɔkɔ bɛngi amobɛndje na ebɔ e nde. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Atombaka moto ogwa miso na ebɔ e nde ko aimaka na nde sokolu e ibonga. Ngɔngɔ amotwueaka masɔi ta miso amobakeaka mɔmɔ ko omohɔdjɔ: «Wenɛkɛ moeka?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Moto ogwaka miso adipoaka miso ko abalaka: «Naenɛkɛ bato, nabaenɛkɛ elenge mele madalaka.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu asɔmbɔkɔ bomobakea naikina mɔmɔ ta miso; moto ogwaka miso aimeaka boenɛ bohu: ahelaka ko atikoanedjaka losusu. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Na bea amoyanedjaka ko abalaka na nde: «Pɛ bosɔmbɔ naikina ta ibonga.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ adimi boo Yesu adi Kilito</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu aimaka na batingami ba nde bakɛkɛ pamba e ibonga i Sedjale e Pilipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sedjale e Pilipo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ngando enɛnɛ edaka mbuti na melo mi ndiba i Yolodane, imikɔmɔ na Pilipo Elode. Busa bu ikabeame Banalasa. </char></note>. Na ndjea, abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ekabale bato ta tina e mbi nde?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Adi bakina, odi Yoane, adi bakina, odi Elia, adi bakina pongono odi omɔti o mbaeli o Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Adi no, mbi nadi nda?» Piɛlɛ amosɔmbedjaka: «Wɛ, odi Kilito.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Na bea, Yesu abasiaka mɛnɛ badae pɛ botɔndea moto.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi bogwa ko bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16, 21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu abangaka botɔndea batingami ba nde: «Etungi Mwana o Moto booka saya enɛnɛ; aloname na basuku ba ibonga, na bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko. Bamowabi ko asapusoabi ngɔngɔ i masu masato.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Abalaka na bu bohu mɛnɛ. Na bea Piɛlɛ asasuaka na nde mo bohali ko amogameaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Endolo Yesu ahombanaka, aendjaka batingami ba nde ko agameaka Piɛlɛ: «Sɔmbɔ sangɔngɔ i mbi, Satana! Malɛno ma wɛ maditi elenge ma Ndjakomba, endolo elenge ma bato.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moda mo bokimana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mat 16, 24-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9, 23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Ngɔngɔ abeaka emumu e bato na batingami ba nde ko abalaka na bu: «Ekada moto mosusu akapala bokimanani, asalone yo mɛnɛ, atombe ekulusu e nde ko akimaneni. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Ekadabo moto mosusu akapala boheledja mohelo mo nde, amobungedjake; endolo moto yona abungedjake mohelo mo nde ta tina e mbi ko tine Bwɛndi Bopele amoheledjabi. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Tɛtɔ adiake moto nda, akatomba ngondo esusu; na bea abungedji mohelo mo nde? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Eka epabi moto na bosɔmbɔtɔnɔ na mohelo nde? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Na bea, yona okabini sɔni ko na mibalo mi mbi ta ndanda e bato ba ehole ye tebasumake Ndjakomba ko bato babe, na bea Mwana o Moto pongono abokabi sɔni ta ekumu e Sange e nde, engbanga na babwɛndji basɛnɔke.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu abalaka na bu naikina: «Okobea, nabali na nu; bakina badi ya batagwabi pɛ boenɛ Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodua na sueya.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokindoa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17, 1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ngɔngɔ i masu masamano, Yesu abeaka Piɛlɛ, Djake, Yoane; ko akɛkɛ na bu ta odiko i ikoli, oho badaka oko bo bɛnɛ. Akindoaka na bu ta miso: <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Bisendja bi nde bimeaka bongɛsɛ ipɛɛ mɛnɛ, pɛ nongo eka emɔti ta kpɔtɔ ebwani boimea ipɛɛ mondumba mua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokokanedja ta 2Piɛ 1, 16-18. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Elia ko Mose babaimaneaka; badaka basola na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na Yesu: «Labi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta kɔpi e Bayuda etingodji Molehi.</char></note>, edi bopele lodae iya. Lopike bitondo bisato, emɔti tina e wɛ, ekina tina e Mose ko ekina tina e Elia.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Aidjebaka eka ebobala, tengasa baimeaka na bɔɔ mɛnɛ! <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Itute ibahuaka na esi e nde ko ta itute imina moholi mokamaka: «Iyo adi Mwana o mbi oepaeli mokeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 11 ko ta</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Mbala emɔti, batingami baendjaka dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ, endolo baiyenɛkɛ naikina moto: oko Yesu yo mɛnɛ engbanga na bu.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ehole edaka bo batite ta ikoli, Yesu abasiaka boo badae pɛ botondea moto meako imenɛkɛ bo, mbunoko Mwana o Moto akasapusoabi ta ndanda e bago. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Babaneaka kɔpi emina, endolo badaka basahɔdjɔ: «Atingodjaka: “Bosapusoa ta ndanda e bago nde”?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Na bea bahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Tina ndani balehi ba mobeko bobalaka etungi Elia adue boso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mal 3, 23.</char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Elia abwani bodua boso tine boisa misusu ta molɔngɔ. Endolo tina nda makomi makabale boo Mwana o Moto atungi aoke saya enɛnɛ ko bamoenɛbi eka ngasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 53, 3; Ndj 22, 1-18.</char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Endolo mbi na balaka na nu: Elia aduaka ehele, ko bato bamonɔngedjaka moda mopalaka bo, elenge makomi mabalamaka tina e nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji mwana otungeamaka na mwembo mobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Ehole ebatamaka bo na batingami bakina, baɛnɛkɛ emumu e bato ko balehi ba mobeko babomaka kitɛ na batingami bakina. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ehole enɛkɛ emumu e bato Yesu, bakamoaka ko bapotaka tine bomoisea. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Kitɛ abomakano na bu eye?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ta emumu e bato moto omɔti amosɔmbedjaka: «Molehi, nolwɛki mwana o mbi momi, tengasa atungeamaka na mwembo mobe mokamoimedje emimi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Polo esusu mwembo momina ekatane mo mwana, bomodumbaka ta kpɔtɔ, na bea mapuli boimaka na nde ta monɔkɔ ko bokpɛkɛlɛkɛ mino, mokuku mosusu bopingaka. Nongɔnɔki batingami ba wɛ boo babengane mwembo momina, endolo bamohɔniti.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Bato bataka e bodima! Mbunoko ehole nda edabi mbi na nu? Mbunoko ehole nda nohɔneni? Duani na mwana!» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Baduaka na mwana. Ehole enɛkɛ mwana Yesu, mwembo mobe mopukusaka mwana na ngulu mɛnɛ ko akwaka ta kpɔtɔ; aimeaka bobilingana ko mapuli maimaka ta monɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ sange e nde: «Bihole beka biyeyoi yogo emina na nde?» Sange e nde asɔmbedjaka: «Donga ta bobwɛngɛ bo nde. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mbala isusu mwembo momina bomodumbaka ta mosa kaoko ta madiba bɛngi agwɛ. Endolo okapala, lokea ndjokwa ko lokamoa!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Okakoka! Misusu mikoki adi yona okadime.»<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Mbala emɔti, Sange mwana alɛbɛkɛ: «Nadimi, kamoani tine taka e bodima!» <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu aenɛkɛ emumu e bato baduaka mbuti na bu; agameaka mwembo mobe: «Wɛ mwembo mu mokimedje moto emimi, ima adi mwana pɛ bosɔmbɔ naikina!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Mwembo mobe moimaka adi mwana na bolɛbɛ ko na bopukusa mwana na ngulu mɛnɛ. Mwana aimeaka elenge moto agwi, ko bato banɛnɛ babalaka: «Agwi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Endolo Yesu amopeaka ta ebɔ, amoangɔdjɔkɔ ko mwana aemaka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ehole eyanaka Yesu ta ndako batingami basasuaka na nde, bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Tina nda iso lohɔniti bobengana mwembo momina?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mondumba mo mwembo mua motungi boima oko na miongɔnɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi naikina pongono bogwa ko bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9, 43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na batingami ba nde badongaka ta polo emina, bakatisaka ibonga i Galilea; ko aipalaka boo bato badjebe polo edaka yo. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Endja, mondumba molakaka yo batingami ba nde: «Mwana o Moto adi mbuti akabame ta mɔmɔ ma bato, bamowabi; ko ngɔngɔ i masu masato, asapusoabi ta bogwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Endolo batingami baisipoaka tine kɔpi emina ko badaka na bɔɔ bomohɔdjɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odi na gala diko i babinande nda?</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ehole eimeaka bo ta ibonga i Kapalanauma, bakweaka ta ndako. Yesu ahɔdjɔkɔ batingami ba nde: «Kitɛ ebomakino na ndjea e ye?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Endolo bo bapɔpɔnɔkɔ; tengasa na ndjea, babomaka kitɛ tine bodjeba moto onɔi binande na gala. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Na bea Yesu asadedjaka, abeaka batingami domi na ibae ko abalaka na bu: «Yona apalaka adae moto o boso, bopele adae moto o ngɔngɔ ko mosali o bato basusu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Atombaka mwana mokɛkɛ amoemeaka ta ndanda e bobo; ngɔngɔ i bomotomba na mɔmɔ ma nde abalaka na bu: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Moto mosusu oasɔi mwana na kombe e mbi elenge mwana i yo, asɔini mbi mɛnɛ; ko yona oasɔi mbi, editi mbi, endolo asɔi yona olomani.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odi pɛ boda soki na su adi o biso</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9, 49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yoane abalaka na nde: «Molehi, loeni moto omɔti bobengana miembo mibe na kombe e wɛ ko lopalaki lomosie, tine boo aditi engbanga emɔti na su.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Endolo Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Pɛ bomosiani, tengasa moto aboaniti bobala bobe tina e mbi, bea ngɔngɔ akɔe embete ebokamoa na kombe e mbi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Tengasa moto odi pɛ boda na soki na su, adi o biso. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Moto obapabi kɔbɔ e madiba tine boo odini bato bakilito, okobea, nabali na nu edi soti: adiabi iputi i nde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dani na edinga na midjɔ mikadumbe bato ta bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18, 6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Endolo yona ataedjake ibaku ta omɔti o bana bakɛkɛ ibakadimeni, ebwani bopele na nde bomotingea ibanga igbɔgbɔ ta dɔli ko bomodumba ta duwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ekadabo ebɔ e wɛ ekolome ta bobe, elena; enɔi na bopele tina e wɛ, bokwea na ebɔ emɔti ta mohelo mopele, ta polo ebobanea mɔmɔ mabae ko bokɛ na mu ta ipelu, ta mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea. [ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Oho, “timo bodɛkɛ mikuku mikadae pɛ bogwa ko ta mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikomi di iditi ta makomi manɛnɛ mayou.</char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ekadabo eko e wɛ ekolome ta bobe, elena; enɔi na bopele tina e wɛ bokwea ta mohelo mopele na eko emɔti ta polo ebobanea mako mabae ko odumbame ta ipelu. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Oho,“Timo bodɛkɛ mikuku mikadae pɛ bogwa ko ta mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea.”] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Ekadabo diso lolomaka ta bobe, longodja; enɔi bopele tine wɛ bokwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba na diso imɔti ta polo ebobanea miso mabae ko odumbame ta ipelu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Oho,“Timo bodɛkɛ mikuku mikadae pɛ bogwa ko mosa mokadae pɛ bodimea”. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Na bea, moda mokalɛlebo ta tina e bokpa bo monana, okobea moda momɔti babamekabi na saya e mosa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tingo e molɔngɔ mu etadjebamaka bopele.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Monana edi eka epele; endolo mokataka ngɛngɛ, wasɔmbedjake bokpa bomina na ye? Daani na monana ta tei e bino ko daani na bogo ino na bakina.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Eleho e Yesu tine bodongedja mwali</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ehole ekinaka Yesu ibonga imina, ahulaka ta ibonga i Yudea ko ta pamba e ibonga ikina i Yolodane. Emumu e bato baputoanaka mbuti na nde, ko abangaka bobaleha, elenge edaka elama e nde. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bapalusai babatamaka mbuti na nde bɛngi bamohɔdje ihɔdjɔ i bomeka. Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Mobeko mo biso malomaka momi bodongedja mwali o nde ta moki?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Ta mobeko mo Mose ekomama nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Mose apaka enɔli adi momi e bokomea mwali mokanda mobowa moki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dit 24, 1.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mose akomaka mobeko mua, tine boo odini na milema mipipo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Endolo ta mbangi e losusu, Ndjakomba ayoaka bato: “Momi ko mwali,” moda mabalaka makomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mba 1, 27; 5, 2.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Na tina emina, momi akinakabi sange e nde na nange e nde ko aputoanabi na mwali o nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />ko bo babae baimeabi moto omɔti.” Na bea, batadabi naikina bato babae, endolo moto omɔti. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Pɛ moto obwani bogbɔtodja yena eputoanedja Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ehole edaka bo ta ndako, batingami basɔmbɔkɔ naikina bohɔdjɔ Yesu tina emina. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Abalaka na bu: «Yona odongedji mwali o nde ta moki ko asɔi mwali okina, akɔi bɔɔli. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Oko moda momina, mwali yona ogbɔti ta moki na mumande ko akwei ta moki mokina, yo pongono akɔi bɔɔli.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu adjongoi bana</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Bato baduaka na bana adi Yesu bɛngi abadjongoe. Endolo batingami bababenganaka. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Ehole enɛkɛ Yesu bea, aokaka saya ta molema ko abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Kinani bana bakɛkɛ badue adi mbi! Pɛ bobasiani, tengasa Bokumu bo Ndjakomba bodi elenge bia badi elenge bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 9, 37</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nabalaka na nu: Okobea, yona odabi pɛ bodima Bokumu bo Ndjakomba elenge mwana mokɛkɛ, moto mina akwetebi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ngɔngimina, atombaka bana basusu ta mɔmɔ ma nde; ababakeaka mɔmɔ ko abadjongoaka.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Modieli na Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Ehole edaka bo na ndjea, momi omɔti aduaka ebango, akwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo Yesu ko amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Molehi mopele, ebwani mbi bokɔ bɛngi nadihe mohelo mo seko nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu abalaka na nde: «Tina ndani obeini molehi mopele? Pɛ moto odi mopele, dongedja oko Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Okadjebe mibeko: “Pɛ bowa moto; pɛ bokɔ bɔɔli; pɛ boiba; pɛ bobala tati e boloa na minawɛ; pɛ bokɔ minawɛ bobe; suma sange e wɛ na nange e wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 20, 12-16; Mob 5, 16-20.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Momi omina amosɔmbedjaka: «Molehi, nakasume mia misusu donga ehele ta bobwɛngɛ bo mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu amoendjaka ko asepaka na nde mɛnɛ. Abalaka na nde: «Otaki oko eka emɔti: kɛɛ, tɛkɛ leka losusu lodi na wɛ ko pa palanga imina adi batakeli ko wadiake madieli ta busa; na bea dua ko kimanani.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Endolo ehole eokaka yo kɔpi emina, mokuku moembɛkɛ na nde ko ayanaka na ndjokwa, tengasa adaka na bodieli bonɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu alaka mɛngɛ dɔngɔ na dɔngɔ ko abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Edi bopipo adi badieli bokwea ta bokumu bo Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Batingami bakamoaka na kɔpi emina. Endolo Yesu abalaka naikina: «Soti bana ba mba, edi bopipo bokwea ta bokumu bo Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Edi na bopɛpɛtɛ tito o kamela anɔe ta iposɛ i sinani, endolo edi na bopipo mɛnɛ adi modieli bokwea ta Bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Batingami bakamoaka naikina bonɔ ko basabaleanaka: «Na bea, ohelabi mɛnɛ nda?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu abaendjaka ko abalaka: «Modjɔ modi bato pɛ bohɔnɔ bokɔ, Ndjakomba adi bomokɔ, tengasa Ndjakomba taembɛkɛ nongo modjɔ momɔti.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Na bea Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Oka, iso lokina misusu tine bokimana wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, edi soti, ekada moto yona okini, tine mbi ko tine Bwɛndi Bopele, ndako e nde, bange i nde, bangɛnɛ i nde, nange e nde, sange e nde, bana ba nde, gbie i nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />ko adiabi mbala mokama bonɔ ta ehole iye ahelaka so edɛdi: ndako, bange i nde, ngɛnɛ i nde, bana ba nango, bana ba nde ko gbie, enɔngi pongono; ta ngondo yena aduake, adiake mohelo mo seko. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Bato banɛnɛ i badi edɛdi boso, badakabi bato ba ngɔngɔ; ko bato banɛnɛ i badi edɛdi ngɔngɔ, badakabi bato ba boso.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu atɔndi mbala e basato bogwa ko bopusoa bo nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yana adakabo badale na ndjea tine bokɛ ta ibonga Yelusalɛmɛ, Yesu adalaka boso bo bobo. Na bea, batingami ba nde badaka na bokɛsɛdji ko bato ibamokimanaka badaka na bɔɔ. Yesu atombaka ekina mbala batingami domi na babae mbuti na nde ko aimeaka bobatɔndea eka emoimeake ngɔngɔ: <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />«Eboani, lokɛni ta ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ, oho Mwana o Moto akabamake ta mɔmɔ ma bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko adi balehi ba mobeko. Bamoleneabi etumbu e bogwa ko bamokababi ta mɔmɔ ma bakɛndɛli. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bamosɛkɛbi, bamotwieyabi masɔi, bamokɛsɛkɛkɛbi mbalake ko bamowabi. Ko ngɔngɔ i masu masato, asapusoabi ta bogwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esɛngɛ e Djake na Yoane</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Djake na Yoane, bana ba Djebede, baduaka adi Yesu ko bamosɛngɛkɛ. «Molehi, lodi na posa boo olokokedje esɛngɛ iye.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Apalaka no nakɔe tina e bino nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Ehole edabi wɛ ta ekumu e wɛ, dima boo lodae mbuti na wɛ, okina ta ebɔ e bami, okina ta ebɔ e bali.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Otadjebakani eka esɛngɛkɛ no. Wahɔnɔkeni bomwaka kɔbɔ emwake mbi? Kaoko wadimakeni bodia inelo e saya adiake mbi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Ko bamosɔmbedjaka: «Soti, labwanake.» Yesu abalaka na bu: «Kɔbɔ emwake mbi, ino wamwakeni ko inelo adiake mbi, ino wadiakeni. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Endolo editi mbi moto obwani bodimedja boo odaeni ta ebɔ e mbi e bami kaoko ta ebɔ e mbi e bali; tengasa polo imina idi tine bato ibabɔngedja Ndjakomba tina e dju.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Ehole eokaka batingami bakina domi meako mimina, baokeaka Djake na Yoane bobe. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Na bea Yesu ababeaka bo basusu ko abalaka na bu: wadjebakani boo, ibia baenɛkɛ so elenge bakumu ba bikomi bakakondje ngondo iya; pongono bakondji ba bato bainedjaka bato ba bobo saya. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Endolo ta tine e bino, midae pɛ bokɔmɔ bea. Na tina emina ekada omɔti o bino akapala adae moto o gala, abwani adae mosali o bakina, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />ko yona apalaka adae moto o boso, atungi adae mosali o bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Tengasa Mwana o Moto aiduaka tine bamosale, endolo aduaka tine bosalea bato ko bopa mohelo mo nde elenge ikabo ta bosikoa bato basusu.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aheledji Balatimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Baimeaka ta ibonga e Yeliko. Ehole eimaka bo ta ibonga emina engbanga na batingami ba nde, ko na emumu e bato, motakeli omɔti ogwaka miso kombe e nde Balatimayo, mwana o Timeyo, adaka adi ta yɔnge ndjea, tine bosɛngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ehole eokayo boo Yesu o Nasaleta adaka anɔe abangaka bolɛbɛ: «Yesu, Mwana o Dapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bato bamogameaka bɛngi apɔpɔne, endolo yo agamaka na ngulu mɛnɛ: «Mwana o Dapiti, okeani ndjokwa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aemaka ko abalaka: «Mobeani.» Bamobeaka ko babalaka na nde: «Sapingedja! Angɔ, aobeaka!» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Na bea adumbaka kasaka e nde ko apotaka adi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Apalaka wɛ nokɔe nde?» Moto ogwaka miso amosɔmbedjaka: «Labuni,» etingodji boo molehi, «kɔɔ boo naenɛ naikina!» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Ko Yesu abalaka na nde: «Kɛɛ, bodima bo wɛ boheledji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boheledja </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Moheledji.</char></note>.» Na mbala emɔti, aenɛkɛ naikina, ko akimanaka Yesu ta ndjea.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Bokwea bo yesu ta Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoa 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Ehole ebatamaka bo na ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ, baimeaka ta Betepasa e Betania, mbuti na makoli ma Olipa; Yesu alomaka batingami ba nde babae. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Abalaka na bu: «Kɛni ta ngando yena edi boso bo bino. Ehole aimeakeno, wataneakeni mwana, o tito okabee bo, ane atingi; yona oda moto pɛ bobakama boso. Motingoani ko duani na yu. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Moto akohɔdjɔni: “Tina ndani wakɔkɔni bea”, balani na nde: “Kumu adi na ikamba na yu, na bea aesɔmbedjakedea pɛpɛlɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Molehi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Moswande. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Amoenɛke iya napɛ ekoka </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makoma makina, bokimana na milɔngɔ, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Na Moswande bamoenɛke iya napɛ ekoka.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bakɛkɛ ko bataneaka mwana o tito omina atingi sokolu, mbuti na ekukɛ, na ndjea; ko baetingoaka. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Bato badaka ena babahɔdjɔkɔ: «Eka akɔkɔ no nda? Tina ndani watingoakani mwana o tito iyo?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Babasɔmbedjaka oko moda mobalaka Yesu na bu, ko babakinaka bokɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bahulaka na mwana, o tito okabee bo ane, adi Yesu. Babakeaka bisendja bi bobo ta diko i tito ko Yesu abakamaka ta diko i yu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja na Zak 9, 9.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Emumu e bato enɛnɛ baandaka bisendja bi bobo ta ndjea ko bakina bapeaka mango ma mabia mabukakabo ta gbie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elenge ta Bakondji ba babae 9, 13, edi esendja eka babee bakumu mako.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bato ibadalaka boso bo Yesu ko na bia bamokimanaka badaka bagama: «Odjana adi Ndjakomba! Ko Ndjakomba adjongoe yona aduake na kombe e Kumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Ekumu edae ta bokumu bua baduake, bokumu bo Dapiti Sange e biso! Odjana ta bisika inɔi na diko i losusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Ndj 118, 25-26 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ekumu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Molɔngɔ 9 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ekumu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Molɔngɔ 10 endja ta Mat 21, 9 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu akweaka ta ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ ta tepelo. Ngɔngɔ iboendja misusu midaka mbuti na nde, akɛkɛ ta ibonga i Betania na bapɔsɔlu ba nde domi na babae, tengasa eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alakedji mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Aya busa, ehole ekinaka bo ibonga i Betania, Yesu aokaka ndja. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aenɛkɛ bohali mole mo pigi molumaka na kasa, akɛkɛ na elɛndɛ ebotanea mbuma; endolo ehole eimeaka yo mbuti na mole, ataneaka oto kasa; tengasa eidaka bodidi bo mbuma i pigi. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na mole mo pigi: «Moto atayabi naikina seko na seko mbuma i wɛ!» Ko batingami ba nde baokaka.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoa 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Baimeaka ta ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu akweaka ta tepelo ko abangaka bobengana bato i batɛkɛkɛ na i basombaka ta ikanga i tepelo. Adumbakaka mesa i batɛki ko na bidie bi batɛki ba bimbenga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta polo emina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edi ta ikanga imɔti i tepelo,edimama adi bato badi pɛ boda Bayuda basendji </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bapaka enɔi adi Bayuda bakɛndɛli basendje palanga i bobo tine bosomba makabo ma bobo kaoka boputa puti e tepelo.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />ko aikinaka nongo moto atombe eka ta tepelo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Na bea, aimeaka bobaleha ko abalaka: «Ta makomi, Ndjakomba abalaka: “Ndako e mbi ebeamabi ndako e miongɔnɔ tine bato ba bikomi bisusu bi ngondo.” Endolo ino, oimedjini etondo e baubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 56, 7; Yil 7, 11.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba na balehi ba mobeko aokaka bo bea, bahombaka enɔeli e bowa Yesu. Na bea, badaka na bɔɔ na nde, tine bato basusu bakamoaka na bileho bi nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Ehole e mɔmɔkɔ, Yesu na batingami ba nde baimaka ta ibonga inɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi makina: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, Yesu na batingami ba nde baimaka ta ibonga enɛnɛ.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu na mole mo pigi mokakanake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21, 20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Aya busa ehuma, yana adakabo banɔe, batingami baenɛkɛ mole mo pigi mokakana mosusu mbunoko nginga. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka malɛno ta meako minɔkɔ ko ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Labi, endja mole mo pigi imolakedja wɛ mokakani mosusu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: edi soti «Dani na bodima adi Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Okobea, nabali na nu: Edi soti, yona obalakabi na ikoli: “Donga ta polo yena ko sadumba ta duwa”, ko amiti daa na kitɛ ta molema mo nde, endolo na edimeli meako mabalaka yo makɔmɔke, makokedjamake tina e nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Na tina emina, nabalaka na nu: losusu lohɔdjɔkɔbino ta miongɔnɔ, dimani boo obolodjini, ko miopamakabini. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ko ehole emino diko tine bongɔnɔ, okada na modjɔ na mwange e wɛ, moyɛ, na bea sange e bino yona odi ta busa aoyɛkeni pongono mabe makɔi no. [ <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Endolo omiti yɛni babinanu, sange e bino odi o diko atoyɛbini mabe makɔi no<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu te motaneame ta makomi mayou. Endja pongono ta Mat 6, 15.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokondji bo Yesu bodonga djɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bahulaka naikina ta ibonga i Yelusalɛmɛ. Yana adakabo ta ikanga i tepelo, banganga ba Ndjakomba, na balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku ba ibonga baduaka mbuti na nde.<verse eid="MRK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Na kpatsi enda akɔkɔ na wɛ midjɔ mi? Opa kpatsi emina nda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Napalaka nohɔdjeni ihɔdjɔ imɔti; sɔmbedjanini, ko mbi notɔndeakeni kpatsi akɔkɔ na mbi meako mimina. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Inelo i Yoane idongaka adi Ndjakomba kaoko adi bato? Sɔmbedjanini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 1, 4-5.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Endolo balɛdjɛkɛ ta tei e bobo ko basabaleanaka: «Lokasɔmbedja: “Idongaka adi Ndjakomba”; alohɔdjɔke: “Tina ndani oidimeani Yoane?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ko lokamosɔmbedja: “Idongaka adi bato...”» Badaka na bɔɔ na emumu e bato, tengasa bo basusu balɛdjɛkɛ Yoane adi soti mbaeli o Ndjakomba.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Na bea basɔmbedjaka Yesu: «Lotadjebaka.» Yesu abalaka na bu: «Edi bopele! Mbi pongono, nitotɔndeakeni na kpatsi e ndani akɔkɔ na mbi midjɔ mimina.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Isɛ li babanei ba milema mibe</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Ngɔngimina, Yesu aimeaka bobala na bu na masɛ: «Momi omɔti aonaka gbie e mele mi vino; aehikaka na ihiko, atɔɔkɔ mombɔndɔ ta ibanga tine bosiana mbuma i vino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Isa 5, 1-2.</char></note> . Ngɔngimina, atongaka naikina egbili oho, apaka gbie emina na basali ko akɛkɛ mwɛngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ehole ebwanaka bodidi bo botswa mbuma, alomaka mosali omɔti adi basali ba gbie bɛngi bamolome i nde ibondo i mbuma. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Endolo basali ba mina bapeaka mosali omina, bamobomaka ko bamoyanedjaka mɔmɔ ngasa. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Na bea, moswa gbie alomaka okina mosali; basali bamina bamobomaka ta molo ko bamokedjaka sɔni. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Moswa gbie alomaka okina mosali, iyo pongono bamowaka. Moswa gbie alomaka naikina basali bakina banɛnɛ; banɔngedjaka bakina ko boawaka bakina. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Adikaka oko na mwana o nde omɔti oepaeli. Abalomeaka moto osuka, tengasa asabaleaka: “Basumake mwana o mbi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Endolo basali ba gbie basabaleanaka: “Endjani motitani! Duani, lomowoeni, ko bodieli bodikake bo biso!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Na bea, bapeaka mwana bamowaka ko bamodumbaka sokolu e gbie e vino.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />«Moswa gbie e vino akɔke yo nde? Ihɔdjɔ i Yesu. Aduake, aowake basali bia ba gbie ko apake gbie emina adi basali bakina. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Oilangani ikomi di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Edi ibanga idumbaka batongi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">imei ikwe i ndonga.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Imua madongaka adi Kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">edi modjɔ mo bokamoa ta miso ma biso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 118, 22-23.</char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakondji ba bato, bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko balehi ba mibeko bahombaka enɔli ebomopea, endolo babangaka emumu e bato. Tengasa basipoaka boo abalaka isɛ imina tine bobo. Endolo bamokinaka boo akɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Puti e mokondji Sedjale</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Balomaka bapalusai na bato ba pamba Elode<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pamba e Elode </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 3, 6 ko na molɔngɔ.</char></note>, tine bohɔdjɔ Yesu ihɔdjɔ ibomomeka. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Baduaka bomotɔndea: «Molehi, ladjebaka boo wɛ okabale soti ko oditi na bɔɔ na moto; toendjake mbanda i bato, endolo okalehe soti ta ndjea e Ndjakomba. Eboani boo lopute puti e kumu monɛnɛ Sedjale? Lotungi boputa kaoko ngasa?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Endolo elenge adjebaka yo boo badi ndjɔ ba melo mibae, abasɔmbedjaka: «Tina nda wapikeakanini elambo? Lwɛnini pata emɔti boo nayenɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bamolwɛkɛ pata emina. Abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ta pata ye, edi na boso ko na makomi ma nda?» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Edi e kumu monɛnɛ Sedjale.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Na bea Yesu abalaka na bu: «Pani kumu monɛnɛ Sedjale leka lobwani na nde, ko leka lo Ndjakomba lobwani na nde.» Ko bakamoaka mɛnɛ na mosɔmbedja mo mina.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɔdjɔ tine bopusoa bo bago</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Basadokai, bo bobalaka bopusoa boditi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 23, 8.</char></note>, baduaka ahɔdjɔ Yesu: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Molehi, endja meako milokomeaka Mose: “Ekadabo momi agwi pɛ bokina bana, akinaka mwali; mwange e nde asɔke mwali yona ko asɔmbedjake denga i mowei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja Mib 25, 5-6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Enakobea edaka na bana bami sambo. O boso amoasɔkɔ ko agwaka pɛ bobota. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />O babae amoasɔkɔ ko agwaka pɛ bobota. Ekɔmɔkɔ pongono na o basato <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />mbunoko o sambo, ngɔngɔ ibo basusu, mwali agwaka pongono. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Ta bopusoa, ehole epusoabi bago, mwali omina adabi o nda? Tengasa basusu sambo bamoasɔkɔ.”»<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Endja tine ibunga i bino; otadjebakani nongo makomi, ko nongo na sueya e Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Na bea, ehole epusoabi bago, bamina bali basɔnetebi, endolo bahelamabi elenge babwɛndji ta busa. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Ta tine bago ko bopusoa, oilangani ta buku e Mose, eka ebalaka Ndjakomba na nde ta ipumba ibwanaka ko pɛ bodimea? “Mbi nadi Ndjakomba o Abalayama, Isaka ko Djakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 3, 2,6.</char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ndjakomba aditi Ndjakomba o bago, endolo Ndjakomba o bato ba bomɔ. Odini mɛnɛ naibunga!»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mobeko monɔi na tina</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Omɔti o balehi ba mobeko abaokaka basabaleana. Elenge asipoaka yo boo Yesu abasɔmbedjaka bopele, aduaka amohɔdjɔ: «Mobeko monɔi na motuya nda?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Endja mobeko monɔi na tina: “Hokamedja Isalɛlɛ! Kumu Ndjakomba o biso adi Kumu okoyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kumu. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kumu adi Ndjakomba o biso, Kumu oko yo.</char></note>; <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Pala Kumu Ndjakomba, o wɛ na molema mo wɛ mosusu, na mwembo mo wɛ mosusu, na bowɛi bo wɛ bosusu ko na ngulu e wɛ esusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mib 6, 4-5.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Mo babae mu: Pala mwange e wɛ elenge akasapale wɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lew 19, 18.</char></note>.” Pɛ mobeko mokina monɔi mibeko imi mibae na motuya.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Molehi o mobeko abalaka na Yesu: «Molehi edi bopele! Eka e bali wɛ edi soti: Kumu adi Ndjakomba okoyo mɛnɛ pɛ okina aditi oko yo mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Mib 4, 35.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ko bomopala na molema mo wɛ mosusu, na bowɛi bo wɛ bosusu, ko na ngulu e wɛ esusu; ko pala mwange e wɛ elenge wɛ mɛnɛ. Enɔi na makabo masusu ko na mbeka isusu, ko bopala mwange e wɛ oko elenge ekasapale wɛ mɛnɛ, enɔi makabo ko na mbeka isusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ose 6, 6.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu aenɛkɛ ko asɔmbedjaka na bowɛi; abalaka na nde: «Oditi bohali na bokumu bo Ndjakomba.» Pɛ moto ohɔdjɔkɔ Yesu ihɔdjɔ naikina.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya ko Dapiti</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu adaka aleha ta ikanga i tepelo ko ahɔdjɔkɔ: «Ndenge nda balehi ba mobeko baboani bobala boo Masiya adi mwana o Dapiti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Dapiti yo mɛnɛ, na ndjea e Mwembo Mosɛnɔke, abalaka:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Kumu abalaka na Kumu o mbi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Daa ta ebɔ e mbi e bami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">mbunoko naise baloni ba wɛ ta nase i bigbota bi wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 110, 1.</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Dapiti yo mɛnɛ amobeaka “Kumu”: moda nda? Masiya abwani adae naikina Mwana o Dapiti?»<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akebedji bato tine balehi ba mobeko</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu abalaka na bu ta bileho bi nde: «Dani na edinga na balehi ba mobeko, bakapale bodala na mikoto miyai, bodimaka ndese i ekumu ta polo i bhuda; <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />bohɔkɔ bidie bi boso ta ba sinagoga ko polo i gala ta tɛkɛ inɛnɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Boyeaka bali bagwa na bami ko bobakoseaka, na miongɔnɔ miyai, bɛngi basinedje boo badi bato bapele. Badiabi esambi epipo mɛnɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikabo i mwali o ngwa na momi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu adaka adi ta boso bo sanga e bipeli, aendjaka moda modaka emumu e bato baisa palanga. Badieli baisaka bibende bi pata. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Aenɛkɛ pongono mwali ogwedjaka momi, motakeli aisaka bibende bi pata ibae bikɛkɛ bi motuya mokɛkɛ mɛnɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta makomi ma mbangi mainedjaka ya bibende bikɛkɛ bibae bi palanga bidi ta mosala. </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Na bea Yesu abeaka batingami ba nde ko abalaka na bu: «Nabali na nu okobea, edi soti: mwali yo ogwedjaka momi motakeli aisi makabo ta sanga bonɔ bato basusu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Tengasa, bato basusu bakabaka leka lodaka na bu napɛ posa ta bodieli bo bobo, endolo yo, akabi losusu lodaka na nde, tine bohelama.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Bobukeana bo tepelo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Ehole eimaka yo ta ikanga i tepelo, omɔti o batingami abalaka na nde: «Molehi, endja mabanga mi mapele! Endja ndako dji ipele!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Wenɛkɛ ndako dji ipele? Etadikake nongo ibanga imɔti ibaki ta diko i ikina; masusu masopeanake.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimbete binedjaka suka e ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu adaka ta ikoli i Olipa, ta boso bo tepelo. Piɛlɛ, Djake, Yoane ko na Andele badaka bo bɛnɛ na Yesu ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Lotɔndea ehole aimeake midjɔ mimina ko embete ainedjake suka e midjɔ mimina.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Dani na edinga ko moto adae pɛ bokoseani. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Bato banɛnɛ baduabi na kombe e mbi ko babalabi: “Mbi nadi Masiya!” Ko babungedjabi bato banɛnɛ ndjea. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ehole eokakabi no kilingo i bila mbuti ko na gala i bila bohali, pɛ bobangani. Etungi midjɔ mimina mimee, endolo edaetebi suka e ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Tengasa ekomi emɔti eanedjabi ekomi ekina, ko bokumu bomɔti banendjabi bokumu bokina. Ta polo itikoanake, edabi na bokumana bo kpɔtɔ, ko na ndja epipo. Edabi elenge mbangi e saya e bobota. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Dani na edinga no bɛnɛ; tengasa bokababini ta ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda ko obomamabini ta ba sinagoga. Baosambendjabini ta boso bo ba gupɛnɛlɛ ko na bakondji, edabi tine bobo tati epele tine mbi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Etungi boso mɛnɛ Bwɛndi Bopele bolehame ta bikomi bisusu bi ngondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ko ehole eopeabini bo tine bakɛɛ na nu ta boso bo esambi, pɛ bodani na bokɛsɛdji na meako mabalake no ta ehole yena. Tengasa editi no bato babalabi edi Mwembo Mosɛnɔke. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Bangi bato bakababi bangi bobo bɛnɛ ta bogwa, ko basange i bato bakɔbi okobea na bana ba bobo; bana banedjakabi ba boti ba bobo ko babowabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mik 7, 6.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Tine kombe mbi, bato basusu bolonabini. Endolo moto yona odabi na lingbangba mbunoko suka, ahelabi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjokwa enɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24, 15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Ehole enɛbi no “mobedji onɔi na bobe” yo aiwei ta polo esɛnɔke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 9, 27; 11, 31; 12, 11.</char></note> Kina boo molangi asipoe bopele! Na bea, ibadabi ta ibonga i Yudea batie ta makoli; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yona odabi ta diko i ndako, atitetebi tine atombe eka emɔti ta ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 24, 17 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />ko yona odabi ta gbie atasɔmbɔ ngɔngɔ tine botomba esendja e nde. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ndjokwa tine bali ba memi ko banungeakabi bana ta masu mamina! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Ongɔnɔni Ndjakomba boo midjɔ mimina misakimea ta ehole e piyɔ epipo! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Tengasa, ta masu mamina, madabi masu ma ndjokwa bonɔ saya yena eipaka daa donga amayoa Ndjakomba ngondo, mbunoko edɛdi, ko edaetebi naikina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Dan 12, 1.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Na bea eseda boo Kumu aikuedja masu mamina, pɛ moto omɔti oboanaka na bohela. Endolo akuedjaka masu mamina tine bia ibahɔmɔkɔ na nde. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ekadabo moto abali na wɛ: “Endja, Kilito adi iya!” Kaoko: “Endja, Adibo!”, Pɛ bomodimea. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Tengasa bakilito ba boloa ko na ba mbaeli ba boloa basangɔdjɔkɔbi ta tei e bino: bainedjakabi bimbete bi bokamoa ko ngindola, tine bobungedja nongo bato ibahɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ino, daani na edinga! Notɔndeakani donga ehele.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bodua bo Mwana o Moto</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Endolo ta masu mia, ngɔngɔ i ehole e saya epipo, modakabusa moimeakabi modidi, songe epaketebi naikina bohu, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Ndjɔtɔ bakwakabi donga ta busa, ko sueya isusu idiko ikumanakabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tine milɔngɔ 24-25, Endja pongono ta Isa 13, 10; 34, 4; Edj 32, 7; Djo 2, 10; 3, 4.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Na bea bato baenɛbi Mwana o Moto bodua ta matute na sueya e nde esusu ko na ekumu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dan 7, 13.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Na bea alomakabi babwɛndji ba nde boputuanedja bia ibahɔmɔ na nde donga ta makono ma ngondo manɛi, donga nase mbunoko suka e busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mib 30, 4; Djk 2, 10; Nem 1, 9.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isɛ i mole mo pigi</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Kinani olehameni na isɛ i mole mo pigi: Ehole esɔmbi tape ibesu na kasa itɔi, wadjebakeni boo bodidi bopele bobatami. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Oko moda momina, ino pongono, ehole enɛkɛbino midjɔ mimina boimea, djebani boo Mwana o Moto adi mbuti, ta ekukɛ e ndako<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Modjɔ. Boimea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mwana o Moto adi mbuti, aimeake. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Mwana o Moto </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, bato ba ehole ye batagwabi boso bo midjɔ mimina boimea. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Busa na kpɔtɔ inɔbi, endolo mibalo mi mbi minɔetebi.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndjakomba yo mɛnɛ adjebaka busa bo suka e ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24, 36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Ta tine e isu kaoko ehole, pɛ nongo moto adjebaka, nongo babwɛndji ta busa, nongo Mwana; endolo oko Tata yo mɛnɛ adjebi. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Dani na edinga! Pɛ bohwɛni, tengasa otadjebakeni ehole emina eduake. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Edabi elenge moto okakɛ mɔndɔ: bokinaka ndako e nde ko bopaka kpatsi e nde adi basali ba nde, moto na moto na mosala mo nde, ko bobalaka na sindjili o ekukɛ boo sɛndjɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Sɛndjɛlɛni, tengasa otadjebakeni ehole ehulabi moswa o ndako: edabi kaoko mɔmɔkɔ, kaoko ta ndanda e bulu, kaoko ta kɔkɔ o boso, kaoko ehuma. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Dani na edinga boo akahula gbundumo, adae pɛ botaneani ohwɛlini. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Meako mabalaka mbi na nu, nabalaka pongono na bato basusu: Dani mosu!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Linginda tine bowa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoa 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Edikaka masu mabae boso bo tɛkɛ e pasika ko miɛmbɛ mapɛ ipetu bokɔme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 12, 1-27.</char></note>. Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko bahombaka enɔeli e bopea Yesu ta mbombi bɛngi bamowoe. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Tengasa babalaka: «Etakɔmɔ ta ehole ye e tɛkɛ, esakapa wusuwusu adi bato.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwali omɔti asopei Yesu mosoloa moso e itindi ta molo</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoa 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Ehole yena edaka Yesu ta Betania, adi Simo, moto o mabha; mwali omɔti akweaka ta ehole edaka bo bayaka, apeaka molangi mokɔmɔkɔ na ibanga ikabe bo abatele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abatele </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 26, 7 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>. Molangi momina molumaka na malasi maso e itindi, mokɔmɔkɔ na mele mikabe bo nale baiputoanedja na eka ekina. Malasi ma mina madaka ma motuya monɛnɛ. Abukaka molangi ko asopeaka Yesu malasi ma mina ta molo mo nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bato ibadaka ena baisepaka na modjɔ momina ko baimeaka bonunguna: «Abedji malasi tina nda? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Eboanaki botɛkisa malasi mamina na motuya moboani na boputa bato mikama misato, ko bopa palanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pata e palanga </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja 6, 37 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note> imina adi batakeli!» <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Endolo Yesu abalaka na bu: «Mokinani bogo. Tina ndani wanungunakani tina e nde? Modjɔ mosakɔ yo modi mopele tine mbi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Tengasa odini na batakeli adi no bihole bisusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mib 15, 11.</char></note>, ko obwanini bobakɔmedjani ta bihole bisusu bidi no bopala; endolo oditini na mbi bihole bisusu. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Akɔi eka eboanaki na nde bokɔ; asopeini malasi tine bobɔngedja mokuku mo mbi boso bo bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makɔkɔ ma malaka ma Bayuda imayou madaka bosopea malasi ta mokuku.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu, bisika bisusu bitɔndɔkɔbi bo Bwɛndi Bopele ta ngondo esusu, babalakabi pongono tine modjɔ mokɔi mwali yo, ko bamolɛdjɛkɛbi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi adimi bokaba Yesu ta mɔmɔ ma bakumu ba banganga</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Na bea Yudasi Isikaliota, omɔti o bapɔsɔlu domi na babae, akɛkɛ adi bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, tine bokaba Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ehole ehokamedjaka bo Yudasi, basepaka ko bamodikanaka bamopɛ palanga. Ko Yudasi ahombaka enɔli epele tine bokaba Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayaki mia ma Pasika na batingami ba nde.</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoa 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ta isu i boso i tɛkɛ e miɛmbɛ mapɛ ipetu, busa bowaka bo bana ba bhata tine tɛkɛ e pasika, batingami ba Yesu bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Apalaka wɛ lokabɔngedja mia ma pasika djɔɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Na bea Yesu alomaka batingami ba nde babae boso ko abalaka na bu: «Kɛni ta ibonga enɛnɛ, wasakanakeni na momi omɔti alwali mbola e madiba. Mokimanani, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />ko polo akweake yo, balani na moswa ndako: “Molehi abali: adi ekenge e ndako ebwani mbi boyaka mia ma tɛkɛ e pasika engbanga na batingami ba mbi djɔɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Yo ainedjakeni ta egbili, ekenge e ndako enɛnɛ ebɔngedjabo na leka losusu loboani oho diko. Edi oho wabɔngedjakeni no mia ma pasika.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Batingami bakɛkɛ ko baimeaka ta ibonga enɛnɛ; bataneaka misusu oko moda mobalaka Yesu na bu, ko babɔngedja mia ma tɛkɛ e pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Ehole eimeaka mɔmɔkɔ, Yesu aimeaka ta polo emina na bapɔsɔlu ba nde domi na babae. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ehole edaka bo ta mesa bayaka, Yesu abalaka: Okobea, «Nabali na nu soti: omɔti o bino, ayaka na mbi, akabakeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 41, 10.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Batingami baimeaka na ndjokwa, ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ omɔti ngɔngɔ i okina: «Edi mbi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu abasɔmbedjaka: «Edi omɔti ta ndanda e bino, omɔti o bino o ba domi na babae, yona wasakanake na mbi ebɔ ta saani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boyaka mia polo emɔti. Endja pongono ta Ndj 41, 10.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Soti Mwana o Moto akɛke oko moda mokomama tina e nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 22, 2-19; Isa 53.</char></note>. Endolo ndjokwa adi moto yona na ndjea e nde Mwana o Moto akabamake! Ebɔngɔkɔ boo moto omina adae pɛ bobotama!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mesa e Kumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Ehole edaka bo bayaka, Yesu atombaka mwɛmbɛ ko ngɔngɔ i bosakoa Ndjakomba, abukaka ko apaka adi batingami. Abalaka na bu: «Tombani, iye edi mokuku mo mbi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Atombaka naikina kɔbɔ e vino ko, ngɔngɔ i bosakoa Ndjakomba, abapaka, ko bamwaka bo basusu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Iye edi makia ma mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 24, 8; Yil 31, 31-34.</char></note>, makia mabwela imasopeami tina e emumu e bato. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Okobea, nabalaka na nu: namwɛtebi vino ye naikina, mbunoko busa bomwakabi mbi vino eyanie ta bokumu bo Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ngɔngɔ iboemba ndjembo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndjembo i tɛkɛ </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 26, 30 ko ta molɔngɔ </char></note>, bakɛkɛ ta ngomba e Olipa.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abali boo Piɛlɛ amoinganeake</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoa 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Ino basusu watiakenini, tengasa ekomama ta makomi: “Nabomake mobanei, ko bwela bo bhata inanganabi pamba isusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dja 13, 7.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Endolo ngɔngɔ ibopusoa bo mbi, nakɛbi boso ambani ta Galilea.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Piɛlɛ abalaka na nde: «Nongo bo basusu bakotia, mbi natotiake.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Na bea Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Okobea, nabali na wɛ, busa bu, ta boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle mbala ibae, wɛ winganeakeni mbala isato.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Endolo Piɛlɛ adaka oko abala: «Ekada bogwa na wɛ, lagwake; mbi nitoinganeake!» Ko bo basusu babalaka oko bea.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aongoni ta Getesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Baimeaka ta polo e kombe Getesemane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 26, 36 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>, Yesu abalaka na batingami ba nde: «Dani iya, yana akɛi mbi aongɔnɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Na bea abeaka Piɛlɛ, Djake, ko Yoane. Aimeaka booka ndjokwa ko asatungeaka mɛnɛ ta molema. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ko abalaka na bu: «Molema mo mbi molumi na ndjokwa mbuti na bogwa; daani iya ko pɛ bohwɛni!» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Asasuaka na bu moobohali, akwaka magbundɔ ta kpɔtɔ ko aongɔnɔkɔ Ndjakomba, ekada bopele, boo ehole ye e saya ekɛe bohali na nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Abalaka: «Aba, Sange e mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kombe e kɔpi e ba Alamɛ etingodjaka sange mbi mɛnɛ.</char></note>, Eboani bokɔ midjɔ misusu; dongedja bohali na mbi kɔbɔ ye e saya. Te bopala bo mbi, endolo bopala bo wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ehole ehulaka Yesu Adibo, abataneaka bahwɛli. Abalaka na Piɛlɛ: «Simo, ohwɛli? Odihiti ngulu eboda mosu nongo moo ehole omɔti? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Dani mosu ko ongɔnɔni, osakakwani ta bomekama. Molema mo moto modi na posa epipo e bokɔ bopele, endolo mokuku modi na bwɛmbu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Asasuaka naikina aongɔnɔkɔ ko abalaka oko kɔpi imina. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ngɔngɔ ahulaka ko abataneaka naikina bahwɛli, tengasa miso mahiyɔ mabanɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Asɔmbɔkɔ mbala e basato ko abalaka na bu: «Ohwɛlini oko ko osahemedjini? Mosi! Ehole eimei! Mwana o Moto akabami ta mɔmɔ ma bato babe! <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Angɔni, lokɛni! Endjani moto okabini adi mbuti!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apeami</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoa 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Na mbala emɔti, ehole yena ebalaka Yesu, Yudasi omɔti o bapɔsɔlu domi na babae, aduaka engbanga na emumu e basoda na mipamba ko na mihukuku. Balomamaka na bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, na balehi ba mobeko ko na basuku ba ibonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudasi, yona okabaka Yesu, abapaka embete: «Momi yona wabhimbake mbi, edi yo. Mopeani ko duani na nde bopele.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Na mbala emɔti baimeaka, Yudasi asabateaka mbuti na Yesu ko abalaka na nde: «Labi!» Ko amobhimbaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Na bea bakwaka diko i nde ko bamopeaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Omɔti o batingami odaka ena aiwaka mopamba, alenaka mosali o nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba itoi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 18, 26.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu abalaka na bu: «Odoini apeanini, na mipamba na mihukuku elenge moweli o bato? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Masu masusu nadaka na nu ta tepelo, ko nalehaka oiduakani apeanini. Endolo kina boo ekɔme bea bɛngi makomi makokedjame.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Na bea batingami basusu bamosundolaka ko batiaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta 14, 27.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mwenga momi omɔti akimanaka Yesu, alwoaka esendja e mbendja. Bamopeaka, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />endolo abasundolaka mbendja emina, atiaka mbundu.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo esambi e banganga</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26, 57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoa 18, 13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bakɛkɛ na Yesu adi nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba, oho adaka bakumu basusu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba, basuku ko balehi ba mobeko baputoanaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Piɛlɛ amokimanaka bohali ko akweaka ta bopango bo ndako e nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba. Oho adaka engbanga na babanei ko baokaka mosa. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bakondji ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda, bahombaka tati ebe tine Yesu bɛngi bamolome ta bogwa, endolo baimodiaka na yu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bato banɛnɛ babalaka boloa tina e nde, endolo tati i bobo ibwanaka idaka ibe. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bato bakina bangɔkɔ tine bobala meako mi boloa tina e nde: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Lomokaka bobala: “nabukake tepelo ye etonga bato, ko ngɔngɔ imasu masato, natongake ekina edi pɛ botongama na mɔmɔ ma bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Yoa 2, 19.</char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Nongo ta mibalo mia tati i bobo ibwanaka idaka ibe. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Na bea nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba asangɔdjɔkɔ ta ndanda emumu e bato ko ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu: «Otasɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi ta pundi idjabalaka bato na wɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Endolo Yesu adikaka bogo, aisɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi. Nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba amohɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Wɛ odi Kilito, Mwana o Ndjakomba yona modjongoamake?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu asɔmbedjaka: «Soti, edi mbi. Ko oenɛbini Mwana o Moto adi ta ebɔ e bami e Ndjakomba o sueya odi ta diko i losusu; omoenɛbini bodua ta matute ma busa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 110, 1; Dan 7, 13.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Na bea mokondji o banganga ba Ndjakomba alakaka bisendja bi nde ko abalaka: «Loditi naikina na posa e batemo! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Okini yo mɛnɛ moda masingaka yo Ndjakomba. Alɛdjɛkɛno naikina nde?» Basusu badimedjaka boo adi mobe ko bamoleneaka etumbo e bogwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta lew 24, 16.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bakina babangaka bomotuea masɔi ta boso, bamonangaka esendja ta boso, bamoindaka ndumɔ ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ: «Elɛ bonganga!» Ko babanei bamotombaka badaka bomoboma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 65 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokanedja ta Isa 50, 6.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛlɛ aingani Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26, 69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoa 18, 15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Ehole edaka Piɛlɛ adi na mobondo ta ikanga i ndako, mosali mwali omɔti o nganga monɛnɛ o Ndjakomba aimeaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aenɛkɛ Piɛlɛ adaka booka mosa, amokokoledjaka ko abalaka: «Wɛ pongono, odaki engbanga na Yesu, moto o Nasaleta.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Endolo amoinganeaka ko abalaka: «Natamodjebaka, natasipoaka eka apalaka wɛ bobala.» Ngɔngimina aimaka bɛngi akɛ ta ikanga i ndako, [oko ta ehole emina, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Makomi makina maditi na kombe, na bea kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Mosali mwali amoenɛkɛ naikina ko asɔmbɔkɔ bobala na bia ibadaka ena: «Momi yo adi omɔti o bobo!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ko Piɛlɛ amoinganeaka naikina. Ngɔngɔ i moo ehole, ibadaka ena babalaka pongono na Piɛlɛ: «Soti mɛnɛ, odi omɔti o bobo, tengasa, wɛ odi mogalilea.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Endolo Piɛlɛ agamaka: «Kina boo Ndjakomba apɛni etumbo ekada boo nakosaka! Nakataka seleka, natadjebaka moto yona wabalaka no!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Oko ta ehole emina, kɔkɔ akɔkɔlɔkɔ mbala e babae, ko Piɛlɛ asɔmbedjaka malɛi ta kɔpi ebalaka Yesu na nde: «Boso bo kɔkɔ akɔkɔle mbala ibae, wainganeakeni mbala isato.» Na bea, abangaka boyea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja 14, 30 </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Abangaka boyea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Ta makomi makina mabalaka boo aimaka pɛpɛlɛ mɛnɛ ayei </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Kaoko alɛdjɛkɛ kɔpi ebala bo na nde ayei, </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Apea mɔmɔ ta molo ayeaka.</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ta boso bo Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoa 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Ehuma mɛnɛ, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba babolamaka ta ibolea inɛnɛ i basuku ba bayuda, na balehi ba mobeko ko na esambi esusu e Bayuda. Ngɔngɔ ibonanga Yesu mbɔti, bakɛɛ na nde amokina ta mɔmɔ ma Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wɛ odi mokondji o Bayuda?» Yesu amosɔmbedjaka: «Edi wɛ moto obali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛ moto obali </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 27, 11 ko ta molɔngɔ.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba bapundaka Yesu na midjɔ minɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Na bea, Pilato ahɔdjɔkɔ Yesu naikina: «Otasɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi? Otokaka midjɔ minɛnɛ mopundaka bo!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Endolo Yesu aisɔmbedjaka nongo kɔpi, ekamodjaka Pilato.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alomami ta bogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoa 18, 39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Engi tɛkɛ e pasika, Pilato adaka aimedja mobɔlɔkɔ omɔti, yona ohɔdjɔkɔ bato. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Enakobea, momi omɔti kombe e nde Balabase adaka ta bɔlɔkɔ engbanga na bato ibalemoaka, ta bolemo bo bobo moto omɔti agwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Emumu e bato baduaka ta ndako e Pilato ko bamohɔdjɔkɔ akɔe tina e bobo elenge elama yo bokɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato abasɔmbedjaka: «Opalini notingoeni Mokondji o Bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Endolo adjebaka bopele mɛnɛ boo, bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba batɛkɛkɛ Yesu na swɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Endolo bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba basumedjaka emumu e bato, boo bahɔdje adi Pilato abatingoe Balabase. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato abahɔdjɔkɔ naikina: «Apalaka no nakɔe na yona okabe no Mokondji o Bayuda nde?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bamosɔmbedjaka na bogama: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato abahɔdjɔkɔ: «Bobe bokɔi yo nda?» Endolo bo basusu bagamaka naikina na ngulu: «Mobaka ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato adimaka bosepedja bato ko abatingoaka Balabase; ngɔngɔ alomaka boo bakɛsɛkɛke Yesu mbalake ko amopaka ta mɔmɔ ma bobo, bɛngi bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basoda basɛki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoa 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Basoda bakɛkɛ na Yesu ta ikanga i ndako e gupɛnɛlɛ ta polo ekasambedje bo midjɔ ko abeaka ebole e basoda. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bamolwoadjaka esendja ekpetu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esendja ekpetu </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Edako oko tine bakumu ko na bato ba gala.</char></note> ko bayoaka egbala e ndjubɛ bamobakeaka ta molo. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Ngɔngɔ badaka bamoisea: «Mokondji o Bayuda, bwanda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bamokɛsɛkɛkɛ na mososongo, bamotwiyaka masɔi ko bakwaka magbundɔ ta boso bo nde na bomota elenge adi kumu. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ngɔngɔ ibomosɛkɛ, bamoiwaka esendja ekpetu ko bamolwoadjaka bisendja bi nde. Ngɔngɔ baimaka na nde sokolu bɛngi bamobake ta ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abakami ta ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoa 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Momi omɔti kombe nde Simo o ibonga i Kulɛnɛ, sange e Alekidjandele na Lupusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bal 16, 13.</char></note>, anɔkɔ ena adaka ahule ta gbie. Basoda bamopeaka na ngulu bɛngi atombe ekulusu e Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bakɛkɛ na Yesu ta polo ekabe bo Gologota, etingodjaka: «Polo e egɔgɔlɔ e molo». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bamopaka mana ma vino mabongoanedjabo na kasa i boyo, endolo Yesu aimwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Ngɔngɔ bamobakaka ta ekulusu ko bakabanaka bisendja bi nde, na boboma djonga, bɛngi badjebe eka adiake moto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 2, 19.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Edaka ehole e ibwa ehuma, emobakaka bo ta ekulusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ikomi inedjaka tina ebogwa bo nde, edaka na makomi mi: «Mokondji o Bayuda». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Bamobakaka engbanga na batɔmbi babae ta ekulusu: omɔti ta ebɔ e bami okina ta ebɔ e bali. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Edi ekokedjeli e ikomi ibalaka: «Alangamaka ta molɔngɔ mo boawoi ba bato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Molɔngɔ mu moditi ta makomi makina mayou.</char></note>.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bato ibanɔkɔ ena badaka bomosinga ko bogbɔkea melo; ko babalaka na nde: «E! Wɛ moto okabuke tepelo ko botokangaka ngɔngɔ i masu masato<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 14, 58; Ndj 22, 8; Yoa 2, 19.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />saheledja ko tita ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Bakumu ba banganga ba Ndjakomba ko na balehi ba mobeko basɛkɛkɛ Yesu babalaka: «Aheledja bakina ko aboaniti bosaheledja yo mɛnɛ! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kina boo Kilito, Mokondji o Isalɛlɛ, atite edɛdi ta ekulusu! Lokenɛdea bea, yana lamodimeake!» Bato ibabakakabo na Yesu ta ekulusu bo pongono badaka bamosinga.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bogwa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoa 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ta ehole e midi, modidi mokɔmɔkɔ ta ngondo esusu ko moyeyoaka mbunoko bihole bisato ngɔngɔ i midi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Ta ehole e basato, Yesu agamaka na ngulu: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lamasabakatani?» –</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MRK 15:34">Etingodji: «Ndjakomba o mbi, Ndjakomba o mbi, okinini tina nda?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndj 22, 2. Elangamaka ta kɔpi e Alameyɛ.</char></note>» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bato ibadaka ena bamokaka ko bagamaka: «Okani, abei Elia!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Omɔti o bobo apotaka ko abokeaka imbusu ta vino e ngayi ko anangaka na ekenge e mososongo. Aepaka Yesu bɛngi amwake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Ndj 69, 22.</char></note> ko abalaka: «Ambani, loendje kaoko Elia aduake amotitedja ta ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Endolo Yesu agamaka na ngulu ko atsweaka molema.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Esendja yena edaka esɛpi ta tepelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Boi 26, 31-33.</char></note> ealeaka bipasa bibae donga o diko mbunoko nase. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Kapitɛni o basoda ba Loma, yona oemaka boso bo Yesu, aenɛkɛ moda motsweaka Yesu molema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agwa mondumba nda </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Makomi makina mabakea </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Na bogama </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bea.</char></note>. Abalaka: «Moto iyo adaki soti mɛnɛ Mwana o Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bali badaka ena, badaka baendja bohali. Ta ndanda e bobo, edaka Malia Magadala, Malia nange Djake, mwange Djodje, ko na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Badaka basalea Yesu misala ta ehole edaka yo ta ibonga i Galilea. Edaka oho pongono bali banɛnɛ ibakɛkɛ na nde ta Yelusalɛmɛ.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu apuseami</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoa 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Mɔmɔkɔ moimeaka, elenge edaka busa bo bosabɔngedja, etingodjaka busa bo boso bo sabata eime; <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Esepu o Alimatayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alimatayo </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Mat 27, 57 ko molɔngɔ.</char></note>, adaka moto o gala enɛnɛ ta ikita inɛnɛ i Bayuda aduaka, yo pongono ambaka bokumu bo Ndjakomba. Adiaka kaso e bokɛ adi Pilato tine bohɔdjɔ mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Endolo Pilato akamoaka boka boo Yesu agwi ehele. Abeaka Kapitɛni o basoda ko amohɔdjɔkɔ ekada soti Yesu agwi ehele. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ngɔngɔ iboka misɔmbedja mi Kapitɛni o basoda, Pilato apaka Esepu enɔli e botomba mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Esepu asombaka mbendja, atitedjaka mokuku mo Yesu ta ekulusu, amohuaka na mbendja ko bamoisaka ta ikila itɔkɔ bo ta ibanga. Ngɔngimina ahilingondjaka ibanga igbɔgbɔ tine bodipa ipose i ikila. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia Magadala ko Malia nange Djodje baenɛkɛ polo esambeaka bo mokuku mo Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Bopusoa bo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoa 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Ehole enɔkɔ busa bo sabata, Malia Magadala, Malia nange e Djake, ko Salome basombaka misoloa miso e itindi, bɛngi bakasopea mokuku mo Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Ta ehuma mɛnɛ e busa bo pɔsɛ, bakɛkɛ ta ikila ehole ekime moi. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Badaka basabalea: «Walodongedjake ibanga ta ipose i ikila nda?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Yana angɔdjɔkɔ bo miso, baenɛkɛ ibanga igbɔgbɔ idaka ihilingodjamake. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Bakweaka ta ikila, baenɛkɛ mwenga momi, alwaka esendja epu, adi ta ebɔ e bami; ko babangaka mɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Mwenga omina abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bobangani; wahombakani Yesu o Nasaleta, iyona obakaka bo ta ekulusu? Asapusoi ta bogwa, aditi iya. Endjani polo emosambeaka bo iye. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Endolo kɛni atɔndeani batingami ba nde ko na Piɛlɛ pongono; “Boo ambakani oho ta ibonga i Galilea: oho wamoenɛkɛni, elenge abalaka yo na nu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta 14, 28.</char></note>”.» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Okobea bali badongaka ta ikila i Yesu, bapotaka, badjoe na bokamoa. Ko baitɔndeaka nongo moto, tengasa badaka na bɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu asinedji na Malia e Magadala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(Endja pongono ta <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoa 20, 11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Milɔngɔ donga ibuwa mbunoko tuku ibae miditi ta makomi makina mayou.</char></note> Ngɔngɔ i Yesu bosapusoa ta bogwa, ehuma e busa bo pɔsɛ, asaenɛmedjaka boso na Malia e Magadala, yona obenganaka yo miembo mibe sambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Malia e Magadala ayanaka ko atɔndɔkɔ gala emina adi bia badaka na nde. Yana adakabo ta ilaka ko boyea. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Endolo ehole eokaka bo mwali bobala: «Yesu adi na bomɔ, na moeni!», Baimodimeaka.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ngɔngimina, asenɛmedjaka na bu na mondumba mokina adi batingami babae badaka bayane ta ndjea e ibonga. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bo pongono basɔmbɔkɔ ko batɔndeaka ba bina bu, endolo baibadimeaka nongo.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Na bea, Yesu asenɛmedjaka na bapɔsɔlu domi na omɔti, ehole edaka bo bayaka; abaosaka mɛnɛ na taka e bodima ko na milema mipipo mi bobo, tine boo baidimeaka bia bamoenɛkɛ ngɔngɔ i bopusoa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ngɔngɔ abalaka na bu: «Kɛni ta ngondo esusu boleha Bwɛndi Bopele adi bato basusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 1, 8.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Iyona odimabi ko adiabi inelo ahelabi; endolo o dabi pɛ bodima amoleneabi etumbo. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Endjani bimbete bienɛmedjamabi adi bia badimabi: na kombe e mbi, babenganakabi miembo mibe; babalakabi kɔpi iyanie; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bapeakabi ndjɔ na mɔmɔ kaoko bomwaka moselo, mobakoetebi nongo bobe bomɔti; babakeakabi mɔmɔ adi bato ba bipeko ko bato bamina bahelabi.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Ngɔngɔ ibobala na bu meako mia, Kumu Yesu aiweaka ta busa ko adi ta ebɔ e bami e Ndjakomba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endja pongono ta Bik 1, 9-11.</char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Batingami bakɛkɛ ta polo isusu tine boleha Bwɛndi Bopele. Kumu adaka asala na bu engbanga emɔti ko abapaka suwea e bokɔ bimbete bi bokamoa, tina e bodimedja mobalo mo nde modi soti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɔpi dji idii ta tei e bikondjo, iditi ta mikanda mikina.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>